EADME.md    | 14 ++++++++++++++\n .../evidence/v1-qualification/rc.11/providers/SHA256SUMS   |  3 ++-\n 2 files changed, 16 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)\nba72d2cbfb8f446254cf829ac5990148fed82500\nba72d2cbfb8f446254cf829ac5990148fed82500\nba72d2cb docs(qualification): bound RC11 provider evidence claims\na8127cb9 docs: record RC11 OpenRouter qualification evidence\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":27830}},"started_at_ms":1793336859342,"completed_at_ms":1793336859342}}
