{"timestamp":"2026-10-30T05:15:00.577Z","ordinal":517884,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a18b3b-9660-7432-b7ec-63ba0ff3c417","author":"/root/pr311_draft_review","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/pr311_draft_review\nPayload:\n**ACCEPT** — base/head `420aa7e1a6d42480c0ec0d3b9bbec21066c27d60`; exact working-tree diff SHA-256 `3decf98b3e8ef70d6f329bbde4765db71ffbf692e78af1a1751eb7a6f61f33c1`.\n\nThe test covers both current CI jobs and the release job ([release_workflow_parity.test.ts](/home/mike/nexus-wt/pr341-release-workflow-fix/cli/test/release_workflow_parity.test.ts:37)). It requires the listed toolchain and sandbox steps before each CLI suite, checks their order, and asserts matching trim-step presence across all three jobs ([test](/home/mike/nexus-wt/pr341-release-workflow-fix/cli/test/release_workflow_parity.test.ts:43)). The current workflows include the trim step before the CLI suite; the release and CI setup agree ([release.yml](/home/mike/nexus-wt/pr341-release-workflow-fix/.github/workflows/release.yml:31), [ci.yml](/home/mike/nexus-wt/pr341-release-workflow-fix/.github/workflows/ci.yml:26)).\n\nNo findings. Read-only source review; tests were not run."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18b36-b9ed-7bf3-88e9-b2dec9ee7bb0","create_time":1793337300.5768142,"content_item_metadata":[{"provenance":{"type":"tool","namespace":"collaboration"}}]}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":23856}}
