{"timestamp":"2026-10-30T05:23:44.718Z","ordinal":518404,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a18b43-95ce-7521-94a9-9b073cafa94d","call_id":"call_1069342a0d434ac69e8f09a440062bf0","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"[{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_summary\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRetrieve stored project-wide summaries.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project identifier.\\nsince_hours : float\\n    Return summaries whose end_ts is within this window (default 24h).\\nlimit : int\\n    Maximum summaries to return (default 5).\\nformat : str, optional\\n    Output format.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_summary(args: { format?: string | null; limit?: number; project_key: string; since_hours?: number; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ result: Array<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>; }>>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_window_identities\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nList active window identities for a project.\\n\\nReturns all non-expired window identities with their display names,\\nlast activity timestamps, and age.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project identifier.\\n\\nReturns\\n-------\\ndict\\n    { identities: [{ id, window_uuid, display_name, created_ts, last_active_ts, expires_ts }] }\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_window_identities(args: { format?: string | null; project_key: string; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };\\n```\"}]"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18b3d-3c3f-73c2-85d3-8d368e2725dd","create_time":1793337824.718204}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
