 and requirements distinctions remain in force: green source checks do not establish installed-RC or release acceptance. No new operator action is needed at this checkpoint.\n\n","started_at":1793337408,"completed_at":1793338090,"duration_ms":682120,"time_to_first_token_ms":1435}}
