{"timestamp":"2026-10-30T05:28:32.635Z","ordinal":518534,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18b47-a54b-7cb0-a56a-8243423701cb","session_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","root_turn_id":"01a18b47-a54b-7cb0-a56a-8243423701cb","response_id":"resp_0db389702a7164cc016ae42afd2784819f866818d71f14cf00","usage":{"input_tokens":158143,"cached_input_tokens":155008,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":461,"reasoning_output_tokens":278,"total_tokens":158604},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":618933,"cached_input_tokens":610176,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":2064,"reasoning_output_tokens":1311,"total_tokens":620997},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":9753193532,"cached_input_tokens":9649714944,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":28060177,"reasoning_output_tokens":16505520,"total_tokens":9781253709}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-30T05:28:34.319Z","ordinal":518535,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18b47-a54b-7cb0-a56a-8243423701cb","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-193151bc-aee8-4f3e-bc65-b0ad8c70065b","process_id":"72333","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","export ENTIRE_TOKEN_STORE=file; entire status --json --no-pager"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/pr341-release-workflow-fix","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"export ENTIRE_TOKEN_STORE=file; entire status --json --no-pager"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"failed","aggregated_output":"Usage:\n  entire [flags]\n  entire [command]\n\nEntire Setup:\n  agent                      Manage agent integrations (add, remove, list)\n  clean                      Clean up Entire session data\n  configure                  Update Entire settings in the current repository\n  disable                    Disable Entire in current repository\n  doctor                     Diagnose and fix session issues\n  enable                     Enable Entire in current repository\n  plugin                     Manage Entire plugins (install, list, upgrade, search, remove)\n  status                     Show Entire status\n\nSessions & Checkpoints:\n  activity                   Show your activity overview\n  checkpoint                 Inspect and search checkpoints\n  dispatch                   Generate a dispatch summarizing recent agent work\n  recap                      Summarize recent checkpoint activity\n  search                     Search checkpoints, commits, and sessions using semantic and keyword matching\n  session                    Manage agent sessions tracked by Entire\n\nTrails:\n  trail                      Manage trails across repositories and branches\n\nAccount:\n  auth                       Manage authentication\n  login                      Log in to Entire\n  logout                     Log out of Entire\n\nControl Plane