{"timestamp":"2026-10-30T05:32:21.678Z","ordinal":518780,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18b47-a54b-7cb0-a56a-8243423701cb","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0db389702a7164cc016ae42be26b08819f8e8744d5c6ee585b","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"**Campaign remains active; acceptance is still `IN_PROGRESS`.** `origin/main` is `38a875ccfeb89f926d2bcf3cc12a37a0cbe40ff5`.\n\nThis turn advanced two local PR candidates:\n\n- **PR #341:** corrected candidate `b2b9ac825c2e3d5a4961d91f020b2a0d1c1f7e45`, based on PR #335 head `391f49bc`. The release workflow no longer invokes the retired runner-trim script, and its parity test checks that it stays absent. Independent review accepted the exact delta; the focused test passed 1/1. `check_requirements.mjs --enforce` exited 0, with 12 requirements still explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification. The corrected candidate has not yet had exact-head CI.\n- **PR #334:** local commit `fb80f2796ba2bf7894f54752c01552bc0e2ef635` withdraws the unsupported RC11 failure claim because the cited logs are absent, while retaining the evidenced RC10 failure and fix demonstration. Independent review accepted the correction; all 65 manifest entries verify. Its remote PR head is unchanged pending PR #335’s gates.\n\n**Still running:** PR #335’s Linux job is in the CLI test step; its Node 22/24 and CodeQL/JavaScript checks passed. PR #341’s older remote head also still has Linux CI running. Both Entire Gates report that no reviewer has approved the trail; the code-review accepts do not satisfy that separate approval gate.\n\nThe latest public release remains RC11. No accepted RC or stable v1.0.0 release is verified. I’m holding the PR updates until the current full-suite jobs finish, to avoid overlapping suite runs. Independent Entire reviewer access remains a later human dependency, as previously discussed.\n\n"}],"phase":"final_answer","memory_citation":{"entries":[{"path":"MEMORY.md","lineStart":580,"lineEnd":620,"note":"release convergence context and distinction between source CI and RC acceptance"}],"rolloutIds":["01a14262-6554-7912-9e3b-5f24d58b12c0"]}},"started_at_ms":1793338338434,"completed_at_ms":1793338341678}}
