te codex-root already prepared in b2b9ac82. Release run gets the CI-proven trim setup now.\n.git/nexus-claims.log:6426:2026-10-30T05:31:00Z PR334_EVIDENCE_CORRECTION base=bb335de6d943e54ff97f3fa03442dc267a91aa9b commit=fb80f2796ba2bf7894f54752c01552bc0e2ef635 independent_review=ACCEPT reviewer=pr311_draft_review proposed_delta_sha256=ccf8bb25b351307e34b8fdaddd740eab7eb5854d8e1691667b894a866fd65f19 RC11_result=NOT_VERIFIED_missing_logs RC10_failure_and_fix_demo_retained manifest=65_of_65_pass diff_check=PASS local_only wait_for_PR335_exact_CI_then_rebase_and_run_PR334_exact_CI no_payloads_accessed\n.git/nexus-claims.log:6427:2026-10-30T05:33:22Z PR334_REBASED_CANDIDATE base=391f49bcddb75e63d73b232b3cdec88a17fd6f66 head=9f59384b7ad9390fac3cabc0cbede15a8c26bdb2 full_diff_sha256=bae047d0a10cbec13ac54ebcef9b53125cb807eeda294a86f32ee310703c740c prior_correction_delta_review=ACCEPT independent_full_candidate_review=PENDING reviewer=pr311_draft_review RC11_result=NOT_VERIFIED_missing_logs RC10_failure_and_fix_demo_retained manifest=65_of_65_pass diff_check=PASS no_suite_run_PR335_CI_active local_only no_payloads_accessed\n.git/nexus-claims.log:6428:2026-10-30T05:33:41Z PR334_FULL_CANDIDATE_REVIEW base=391f49bcddb75e63d73b232b3cdec88a17fd6f66 head=9f59384b7ad9390fac3cabc0cbede15a8c26bdb2 disposition=ACCEPT reviewer=pr311_draft_review diff_sha256=bae047d0a10cbec13ac54ebcef9b53125cb807eeda294a86f32ee310703c740c manifest=65_of_65_pass RC11_result=NOT_VERIFIED_missing_logs RC10_failure_and_fix_demo_retained exact_PR_CI_waits_for_active_PR335_PR341_suite_jobs local_only no_payloads_accessed\n.git/nexus-claims.log:6429:2026-10-30T05:35:03Z CI_PROGRESS PR335 head=391f49bcddb75e63d73b232b3cdec88a17fd6f66 Node22=PASS Node24=PASS CodeQL=PASS JS_TS=PASS Linux=IN_PROGRESS_package-linux.sh_v1.0.0-rc.12 Entire=pending_no_reviewer_approval; PR341 remote=420aa7e1 REDACTED.0.0-rc.13 Entire=pending; PR334 local_candidate=9f59384b on PR335 base independent_review=ACCEPT manifest=65/65; PR341 corrected_local_candidate=b2b9ac82 independent_review=ACCEPT targeted_test=1/1; no overlapping local suite run no push or merge\n.git/nexus-claims.log:6432:2026-10-30T05:36:24Z claude-code RELEASE_TAG v1.0.0-rc.13 pushed target=1acff70018c00c2459c388f34dfb2997b8b4d7c6 release_run=41009328850. RC12 never published; RC13 = same product as RC12 tag + release.yml evaluator setup. PR335 may now rebase (drop trim from release.yml per b2b9ac82). After publication, REQUEST lanes re-run on exact rc.13 artifact: E2 20-cell + power-loss, §5.2 scripted PTY (named s9 probe), E5 provider, cross-runner repro.\n.git/nexus-claims.log:6433:2026-10-30T05:37:22Z PR341_MERGED_RECONCILIATION remote_head=420aa7e1 merge_commit=1acff70018c00c2459c388f34dfb2997b8b4d7c6 merged_at=05:35:46Z Node22_Node24_Linux_CodeQL_JS_TS=PASS Entire_Gates=NEUTRAL_not_approval; release workflow trim-step mismatch will arise when PR335 removes CI trim; corrected fix candidate=b2b9ac82 reviewer=ACCEPT focused_test=1/1 local_only needs_current_main_rebase_after_PR335; PR335 head=391f49bc Linux=repro_package_in_progress Entire=review_pending\n.git/nexus-claims/FILE_eval_toolchain-versions.json/owner.json:4:  \"branch\": \"v1/eval-agent-toolchain-binds\",\n.git/nexus-claims/FILE_eval_toolchain-versions.json/owner.json:5:  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/eval-agent-toolchain-binds\",\n.git/nexus-claims/FILE_docs_reviews_evidence_v1-qualification_rc.10_platform-e2_README.md/owner.json:11:  \"status\": \"PR334 evidence correction locally integrated into full candidate 9f59384b7ad9390fac3cabc0cbede15a8c26bdb2 on PR335 exact base; independent full-candidate review ACCEPT; RC11 NOT VERIFIED due absent logs, RC10 failure and fixed-CLI demo retained; manifest 65/65 and diff check pass. Exact PR CI not run to avoid overlap with active PR335/PR341 suite jobs; branch local only.\",\n.git/nexus-claims/FILE_eval_oracle.mjs/owner.json:4:  \"branch\": \"v1/eval-agent-toolchain-binds\",\n.git/nexus-claims/FILE_eval_oracle.mjs/