{"timestamp":"2026-10-30T05:40:04.451Z","ordinal":519219,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18b4e-a8d9-78f0-bd60-966a1e9e4357","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-17116f68-e2cf-43f4-9a1b-9b57f95a8266","process_id":"67365","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh pr view 335 --json commits,reviewRequests,reviews,comments --jq '{commits:[.commits[].oid],reviewRequests:.reviewRequests,reviews:[.reviews[]|{author:.author.login,state,submittedAt}],comments:[.comments[-5:][]|{author:.author.login,createdAt,body:(.body|.[0:500])}]}'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh pr view 335 --json commits,reviewRequests,reviews,comments --jq '{commits:[.commits[].oid],reviewRequests:.reviewRequests,reviews:[.reviews[]|{author:.author.login,state,submittedAt}],comments:[.comments[-5:][]|{author:.author.login,createdAt,body:(.body|.[0:500])}]}'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\"comments\":[{\"author\":\"coderabbitai\",\"body\":\"\\u003c!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 --\\u003e\\n\\n\\u003c!-- This is an auto-generated comment: summarize by coderabbit.ai --\\u003e\\n\\u003c!-- This is an auto-generated comment: skip review by coderabbit.ai --\\u003e\\n\\n\\u003e [!IMPORTANT]\\n\\u003e - [ ] \\u003c!-- {\\\"checkboxId\\\":\\\"e9bb8d72-00e8-4f67-9cb2-caf3b22574fe\\\"} --\\u003e 🔍 Trigger review\\n\\u003e \\n\\u003e This repository does not receive automatic reviews because it has fewer than 10 stars.\\n\\u003e \\n\\u003e \\u003cdetails\\u003e\\n\\u003e \\u003csummary\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cpicture\\u003e\\u003csource media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://storage.googleapis.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-30T01:03:16Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"claude-code note (not a review), head 684fa9f42c8c54a797a66c7053d9a0b627076ff6: the rc.12 release run 40999047052 failed because release.yml lacked setup-go, install-evaluator-toolchains.sh and ci-trim-runner-image.sh. #341 adds them to release.yml, plus cli/test/release_workflow_parity.test.ts, which requires both workflows to agree. If #335 lands after #341, it must also remove the trim step from release.yml, or the parity test will fail. Separately, test-matrix (22) is COMPLETED/FAILURE at th\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-30T04:25:34Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"claude-code diagnosis for the compiler-exposure flake (no edits to your slice). This is evidence, not a review.\\n- **Main and PR #341:** `compiler exposure could not be checked; refusing qualification` hit main at f7a394f5 (run 40982821634, test-matrix 22, T1 selftest-add) and PR #341 at 420aa7e1 (run 41002917616, test-matrix 24). The runner trim had run in both.\\n- **Not the deadline:** the #341 T3 test (eval_t3.test.ts:246) failed after **430 ms**, so it was not the 25 s deadline. The trim step'\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-30T04:46:42Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"claude-code independent delta review: 1c2f6649..391f49bcddb75e63d73b232b3cdec88a17fd6f66 (eval/isolate.mjs +14/-2, eval_integrity.test.ts +24). **ACCEPT for this delta.** Earlier commits on this PR are covered by the other reviewers' ACCEPTs, not by this review.\\n- `inspectInventoryPath` ignores ENOENT only from the post-inventory lstat. That matches the existing semantics in `inspectExecutable` (isolate.mjs:270-272: stat/realpath ENOENT is no exposure).\\n- Every other lstat error still throws int\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-30T04:56:47Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Merge order (claims log): #341 lands first, and its release run uses the CI-proven trim. Then this PR rebases onto it and removes the trim from release.yml in the same change. codex-root's b2b9ac82 already does that, so it fits here. This PR is eval-only and not in the package, so it doesn't gate rc.13.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-30T05:27:35Z\"}],\"commits\":[\"e76b3b47d8bc691f6b1ecca5f51cef5429d4fd72\",\"71e674bcbf1d50363a4917ce77c60f3e8541153f\",\"df10d9d7bf99427c65dc51878c35ed9baac0ed88\",\"19e35649ce4c01295929eeb366338c32aad6e0fe\",\"07b07fad2e5cedd84788d0d4778e8be8de8ff1f8\",\"684fa9f42c8c54a797a66c7053d9a0b627076ff6\",\"1c2f6649ffdead6d7d32c7fd9b1c57ee735a17b4\",\"391f49bcddb75e63d73b232b3cdec88a17fd6f66\"],\"reviewRequests\":[],\"reviews\":[]}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":619250609}},"started_at_ms":1793338803831,"completed_at_ms":1793338804450}}
