ed.\ndocs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:99:**Qualification and custody:** Public `v1.0.0-rc.10` is still the latest release (published 2026-10-27); the package at `b293b44` is also `1.0.0-rc.10`, so source changes require a successor RC before installed-RC qualification. No accepted RC or stable v1.0.0 exists. Held-out issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open; its latest public status request was posted 2026-10-28 12:42 UTC, with no custodian response as of this checkpoint. The public 40-task manifest is not custody acceptance, and no held-out qualification has started. T2/T3/T4, evaluator/custody acceptance, remaining provider and standalone gates, cross-runner reproducibility, and independent exact-RC acceptance remain incomplete. The manual five-terminal by three-size matrix remains 0/15; the Ubuntu desktop has setup evidence only, with no qualifying screenshots or cell verdicts recorded.\ndocs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:107:**Authoritative source and source checks:** `origin/main` is `7970958749fc17be3b0ef4bb725b8e2f0d825ed4`, merge commit for PR [#297](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/297). Its exact-head Node 22/24, Linux, JS/TS, and CodeQL checks passed; Entire Gates was neutral. Post-merge CI [40652572596](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40652572596) is running and CodeQL [40652572591](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40652572591) passed. Exact-main CI [40647479745](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40647479745) completed successfully on its parent source commit `ceaf60072b7c364edac523d2517fb12df8f5f6cd`, including Node 22/24 tests, Linux tests, packaging, reproducibility, SBOM, and installer checks. The requirements gate also passed on exact current main `7970958749fc17be3b0ef4bb725b8e2f0d825ed4` in an isolated worktree (123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 applicable release-qualification rows remain deferred to their documented exact-RC stages). PR [#300](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/300) is being updated to this exact main revision. Source checks do not establish installed-RC acceptance.\ndocs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:111:**Lifecycle, scheduler, and evaluation evidence:** `cli/test/convergence_integration.test.ts` covers end-to-end scheduling and execution scenarios. `cli/test/convergence_scheduler_properties.test.ts` runs generated DAG invariants over 100 fixed seeds; this is reproducible generated coverage, not a claim that every scheduler property or arbitrary graph has been proven. PR #297’s regression tests for the TDD diagnostic paths are merged and its required CI passed. The `eval/` pilot suite does not satisfy held-out acceptance: the independent 40-task corpus, custody acceptance, and exact-RC qualification remain required and open.\ndocs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:115:**Qualification and publication:** Public `v1.0.0-rc.10` remains the latest prerelease; no stable `v1.0.0` release exists. Held-out T2/T3/T4, remaining live-provider and standalone gates, successor-RC artifact qualification, cross-runner evidence, the 15-cell human terminal matrix, and independent exact-RC acceptance remain incomplete. Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; stable publication remains gated on these mandatory checks.\ndocs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:129:**Qualification and publication:** Public `v1.0.0-rc.10` remains the latest prerelease, built from immutable source `16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0`; no stable `v1.0.0` release exists. Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open and was last updated 2026-10-27 18:47 UTC; no custodian acceptance or compatible sealed held-out corpus is recorded, and no held-out payload has been accessed. T2/T3/T4, evaluator custody/host acceptance, remaining live provider and standalone gates, qualification of a candidate built from current source, and independent exact-RC acceptance remain incomplete. The five-terminal by three-size matrix remains **0/15 formally recorded cell verdicts**, with no screenshots. The operator reports successful rendering at tested sizes but a 43×13 lower limit for tmux inside GNOME Terminal; this is partial observation, not completion of the prescribed matrix. The available `mike-dev` shell is headless, and its configured `ubuntu-desktop` host name does not resolve, so I could not produce real-terminal screenshots or verdicts from this session. Stable publication remains gated on every required acceptance gate.\ndocs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:143:**Qualification and publication:** Public `v1.0.0-rc.10` remains the latest release and is still a prerelease; its immutable source is `16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0`. No stable `v1.0.0` exists. Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open without an independent custodian acceptance or a compatible sealed held-out corpus; no held-out payload has been accessed. T2/T3/T4, evaluator custody/host acceptance, remaining live provider and standalone gates, qualification of a candidate built from current source, and independent exact-RC acceptance remain incomplete. The required five-terminal by three-size matrix has **0/15 formally recorded cell verdicts** and no screenshots. The operator reports that the client rendered at the sizes tried, but tmux inside GNOME Terminal could not be reduced below 43×13; this does not establish every prescribed interaction or matrix cell. Stable publication remains gated on all required acceptance gates.\ndocs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:149:**Authoritative source and checks:** `origin/main` is `7ddce16a900d2da9def27d53722243bf4df2de07`, merging PR #284 atop PR #283 and earlier RC10 fixes. Post-merge CI [40593091251](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40593091251) completed successfully on this exact SHA: Node 22, Node 24, and Linux packaging/reproducibility/smoke jobs passed. CodeQL [40593091302](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40593091302) also passed. On the refreshed readiness worktree, requirements enforcement passed (123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification), and version synchronization confirms every component remains `1.0.0-rc.10`. These are source checks, not installed-RC acceptance.\ndocs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:159:**Qualification and publication:** Public `v1.0.0-rc.10` remains the newest prerelease on source `16ee8ca`; stable `v1.0.0` is unpublished. Held-out custody acceptance and compatible frozen T2 data remain unresolved (issue #1 is open with no custodian response); T2/T3/T4, evaluator-host acceptance, the remaining live provider and standalone gates, and independent exact-RC acceptance are incomplete. The human five-environment by three-size terminal matrix remains **0/15**, pending the operator; no per-cell verdict or evidence is recorded. Keep stable publication gated on every required acceptance gate.\ndocs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:165:**Authoritative source and checks:** `origin/main` is `fc582c66bf70e00938eedc0ce3cafc635f582540`, merging PR #279 after #278 and #277. Post-merge CI [40566591904](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40566591904) is running Node 22 and Node 24 on that exact SHA; CodeQL [40566591883](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40566591883) passed. Exact-main CI and CodeQL also passed on parent `cf05322` (runs [40561348972](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40561348972) and [40561348985](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40561348985)). Source requirements and RC10 version-sync checks passed on `cf05322` (123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 requirements remain explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification). These are source-gate results, not installed-RC acceptance.\ndocs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:171:**Qualification and publication:** RC10 remains a prerelease; no stable `v1.