uring checkpoint and retention operations. Its exact diff received conflicting review dispositions: a GitHub review comment requested changes for a hook-discovery race and retention error accounting, while a separate read-only review returned ACCEPT. The findings remain unresolved pending the claimed implementation owner's response; no acceptance or merge is claimed. Node 22/24, CodeQL, and JavaScript/TypeScript checks pass; Linux CI remains in progress.\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18b4e-a8d9-78f0-bd60-966a1e9e4357","create_time":1793341830.8576436}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
