{"timestamp":"2026-10-30T06:32:56.788Z","ordinal":520598,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18b4e-a8d9-78f0-bd60-966a1e9e4357","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0db389702a7164cc016ae43a18209c819fbb1c2588d1b2dbfe","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"I found a release-critical durability fix that had looked stalled: Kimi’s upgrade fsync change is already in PR #333, merged as `d06f3748`, and that PR’s Node 22/24, Linux, CodeQL, and JS/TS checks passed. Current `origin/main` contains that commit. I’m closing the obsolete claim record without touching the separate untracked evidence in its worktree."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793341976145,"completed_at_ms":1793341976788}}
