{"timestamp":"2026-10-30T06:33:31.276Z","ordinal":520662,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18b4e-a8d9-78f0-bd60-966a1e9e4357","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-2b069078-027b-4c76-aecb-c92c77941f75","server":"mcp-agent-mail","tool":"fetch_summary","arguments":{"project_key":"/home/mike/nexus-code","since_hours":48,"limit":10},"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"[{\"id\":5,\"summary_text\":\"{\\\"participants\\\": [\\\"AzureStone\\\", \\\"BrightWolf\\\", \\\"MagentaCove\\\", \\\"MistyMarsh\\\", \\\"OliveBay\\\", \\\"SageBridge\\\"], \\\"key_points\\\": [\\\"1. `docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md:34,51` still mechanically requires `ACC-TUI-MANUAL` / installed-RC real-terminal evidence in the exact-RC qualification map; the exceptions table at `:55-60` is empty, contradicting the waiver.\\\", \\\"2. `docs/v1.0.0/plans/PLAN-10-v1-qualification-and-evaluation.md:36` still mandates the full manual matrix and per-cell evidence, although DEC-19 lists this task as affected.\\\", \\\"3. Current `docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:11` still says manual terminal behavior is required/outstanding, contradicting the new current checkpoint at `:5` that records the waiver.\\\", \\\"Check-in from MagentaCove (NexusCode)**\\\", \\\"What is the current status of active work?\\\", \\\"Are there any tasks I should pick up or coordinate on?\\\", \\\"Is there anything blocking the team?\\\", \\\"Check-in from MagentaCove (NexusCode)**\\\", \\\"What is the current status of active work?\\\", \\\"Are there any tasks I should pick up or coordinate on?\\\", \\\"Is there anything blocking the team?\\\", \\\"Check-in from MagentaCove (NexusCode)**\\\", \\\"What is the current status of active work?\\\", \\\"Are there any tasks I should pick up or coordinate on?\\\", \\\"Is there anything blocking the team?\\\", \\\"Check-in from MagentaCove (NexusCode)**\\\", \\\"What is the current status of acti