{"timestamp":"2026-10-30T06:34:56.738Z","ordinal":520778,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a18b84-c562-7f63-8958-295fea120bda","call_id":"call_abdbc4391d964b50a1b8c7be20ca55d5","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 2.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"# Task Group: Nexus v1 CI prerequisite integration and release qualification handoff\nscope: Integrate reviewed CI prerequisites and accurately track Nexus v1 release gates, claims, and held-out boundaries; use for `v1/integration` readiness work, not as a substitute for exact-RC qualification.\napplies_to: cwd=/home/mike/nexus-code (worktree used: /home/mike/nexus-wt/p10g-rebased); reuse_rule=recheck integration HEAD, claim ownership/staleness, exact CI, acceptance documents, and release state; recorded alpha.2 status and blockers are time-specific.\n\n## Task 1: Monitor exact-head CI/reviews and merge PR #10 without calling it a release, success for integration; partial for qualification\n\n### rollout_summary_files\n\n- rollout_summaries/2026-10-16T01-45-07-stRS-t5820_assessment_and_nexus_v1_release_monitoring.md (cwd=/home/mike/Projects/aihost, rollout_path=/home/mike/.codex/sessions/2026/10/16/rollout-2026-10-16T01-45-07-01a14262-6554-7912-9e3b-5f24d58b12c0.jsonl, updated_at=2026-10-18T01:41:41+00:00, thread_id=01a14262-6554-7912-9e3b-5f24d58b12c0, PR #10 integrated; qualification blocked)\n\n### keywords\n\n- Nexus v1, PR #10, bdc705e593def11ee5e44a6ebd0703b57e5953a0, CI 39085388798, v1/integration, 2c70d39ad4f9c29cff04c909eef9de6d2a29bdb2, check_requirements.mjs --enforce, REQ-QUAL-101, ACCEPTANCE.md, CONCURRENCY.md\n\n## Task 2: Record readiness status while the claim is active, success\n\n### rollout_summary_files\n\n- rollout_summaries/2026-10-16T01-45-07-stRS-t5820_assessment_and_nexus_v1_release_monitoring.md (cwd=/home/mike/Projects/aihost, rollout_path=/home/mike/.codex/sessions/2026/10/16/rollout-2026-10-16T01-45-07-01a14262-6554-7912-9e3b-5f24d58b12c0.jsonl, updated_at=2026-10-18T01:41:41+00:00, thread_id=01a14262-6554-7912-9e3b-5f24d58b12c0, held-out payload preserved; readiness files untouched)\n\n### keywords\n\n- FILE_docs_v1.0.0_READINESS.md, PLAN-10_READINESS_T2, nexus-claims, stale claim, 24-hour threshold, PR #9, held-out, fresh branch CI\n\n## User preferences\n\n- reviewers and the release workflow distinguish source/CI acceptance from RC/product qualification -> never call a green CI run a release. [Task 1]\n- when shared readiness/governance files are claimed, coordinate claim release or wait for the documented stale threshold; do not access held-out payloads or edit the artifact meanwhile. [Task 2]\n\n## Reusable knowledge\n\n\n--- local repos ---\n## main...origin/main [ahead 1, behind 1624]\n M .claude/settings.json\n M AGENTS.md\n M cli/dist/agent.js\n M cli/dist/core/state.js\n M cli/package.json\n M cli/src/agent.ts\n M cli/src/checkpoint.ts\n M cli/src/core/durable_file.ts\n M cli/src/core/persistence_protection.ts\n M cli/src/core/state.ts\n M cli/src/flight.ts\n M cli/src/knowledge.ts\n M cli/src/session.ts\n M cli/test/compaction_continuity.test.ts\n M core/tests/adversarial_path_traversal.rs\nA  docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md\nA  docs/v1.0.0/REQUIREMENTS.md\nA  scripts/check_requirements.mjs\n?? .entire/agent-guide.md\n?? CLAUDE.md\n?? WORK_PRODUCT.md\n?? check_in_agents.py\n?? checkin-agents.md\n?? checkin.py\n?? cli/test/agent_prompt.test.ts\n?? cli/test/helpers/setup.ts\n?? cli/test/home_isolation.test.ts\n?? cli/test/persistence_hygiene.test.ts\n?? docs/codebase-review-enhancements.md\n?? docs/enhancement-opportunities.md\n?? docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/\n?? docs/v1.0.0/AUDIT.md\n?? docs/v1.0.0/CONCURRENCY.md\n?? docs/v1.0.0/DECISIONS.md\n?? docs/v1.0.0/EVIDENCE.md\n?? docs/v1.0.0/LANGSMITH_REVIEW.md\n?? docs/v1.0.0/README.md\n?? docs/v1.0.0/ROADMAP.md\n?? docs/v1.0.0/SHA256SUMS\n?? docs/v1.0.0/agents/\n?? docs/v1.0.0/evidence/\n?? docs/v1.0