{"timestamp":"2026-10-30T06:38:06.347Z","ordinal":520948,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18b4e-a8d9-78f0-bd60-966a1e9e4357","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-e41e0784-c5ba-47d3-8471-fa7c07d55724","process_id":"4318","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh issue view 1 --comments --json title,state,assignees,updatedAt,comments --jq '{title,state,assignees:[.assignees[].login],updatedAt,comments:[.comments[-5:][]|{author:.author.login,createdAt,body}]}' | head -c 6500"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh issue view 1 --comments --json title,state,assignees,updatedAt,comments --jq '{title,state,assignees:[.assignees[].login],updatedAt,comments:[.comments[-5:][]|{author:.author.login,createdAt,body}]}' | head -c 6500"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"specify only one of --comments or --json\n\nDisplay the title, body, and other information about an issue.\n\nWhen `--comments` is used, terminal output includes the issue details and comments.\nWhen output is piped or redirected, only the comments are printed.\n\nWith `--web` flag, open the issue in a web browser instead.\n\nFor more information about output formatting flags, see `gh help formatting`.\n\nUSAGE\n  gh issue view {<number> | <url>} [flags]\n\nFLAGS\n  -c, --comments          View issue comments\n  -q, --jq expression     Filter JSON output using a jq expression\n      --json fields       Output JSON with the specified fields\n  -t, --template string   Format JSON output using a Go template; see \"gh help formatting\"\n  -w, --web               Open an issue in the browser\n\nINHERITED FLAGS\n      --help                     Show help for command\n  -R, --repo [HOST/]OWNER/REPO   Select another repository using the [HOST/]OWNER/REPO format\n\nJSON FIELDS\n  assignees, author, blockedBy, blocking, body, closed, closedAt,\n  closedByPullRequestsReferences, comments, createdAt, id, isPinned, issueType,\n  labels, milestone, number, parent, projectCards, projectItems, reactionGroups,\n  state, stateReason, subIssues, subIssuesSummary, title, updatedAt, url\n\nLEARN MORE\n  Use `gh <command> <subcommand> --help` for more information about a command.\n  Read the manual at https://cli.github.com/manual\n  Learn about exit codes using `gh help exit-codes`\n  Learn about accessibility experiences using `gh help accessibility`\n\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":546189}},"started_at_ms":1793342286343,"completed_at_ms":1793342286344}}
