  ·  **Platform:** linux x86_64\n\n**Pointed at:** nexus-cli index: provider and local appliance connection TUI\n\n**Used it for:** reference coding for Nexus provider selection investigation\n\n**Verdict:** Definition-first search located provider catalog, local appliance selection, and connection paths quickly. The attempted --limit option was not supported; the CLI help identified -k, and the corrected query returned relevant source locations. No reranking was used.\n\n**Numbers:** xerj search first attempt: rejected unsupported --limit; corrected search: 8 passages\n\n**Filed alongside:** Nexus provider setup investigation\n\n\n# Ready-to-run — files ONLY the field report, nothing else.\n# Run these in a clone of xerj-org/xerj, not in the project you are working in.\ngit clone https://github.com/xerj-org/xerj.git\ncd xerj\ngh repo fork xerj-org/xerj --remote --remote-name xerj-fork\nxerj feedback \\\n --agent \"GPT-6.1 Codex\" \\\n  --used-for \"reference coding for Nexus provider selection investigation\" --pointed-at \"nexus-cli index: provider and local appliance connection TUI\" \\\n  --verdict \"Definition-first search located provider catalog, local appliance selection, and connection paths quickly. The attempted --limit option was not supported; the CLI help identified -k, and the corrected query returned relevant source locations. No reranking was used.\" --numbers \"xerj search first attempt: rejected unsupported --limit; corrected search: 8 passages\" \\\n  -o user-feedback/16-agent-field-reports/2026-10-30-reference-coding-for-nexus-provider-selection.md\ngit checkout -b field-report/reference-coding-for-nexus-provider-selection\ngit add user-feedback/16-agent-field-reports/2026-10-30-reference-coding-for-nexus-provider-selection.md\ngit commit --only user-feedback/16-agent-field-reports/2026-10-30-reference-coding-for-nexus-provider-selection.md -m \"docs(field-report): reference-coding-for-nexus-provider-selection\"\ngit push -u xerj-fork field-repo