er hot-file claims merges first.\ndocs/v1.0.0/CONCURRENCY.md:95:| Claims | `$(git rev-parse --git-common-dir)/nexus-claims/` | Who owns which slice or file right now |\ndocs/v1.0.0/CONCURRENCY.md:96:| Claim log | `$(git rev-parse --git-common-dir)/nexus-claims.log` (append-only, one line per event) | Claim, release, broken claim, boundary request |\ndocs/v1.0.0/CONCURRENCY.md:102:The following groupings can run at the same time with no hot-file contention beyond §4 claims. They are listed by milestone.\ndocs/v1.0.0/CONCURRENCY.md:110:| M4 (alongside M3) | PLAN-08 PR-8b..8e. Coordinate with PLAN-04 on `state.ts` through `FILE_` claims. |\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18b8d-60e7-7130-962f-f0eb9e68c409","create_time":1793344803.0776908}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
