{"timestamp":"2026-10-30T07:21:54.727Z","ordinal":522006,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18b8d-60e7-7130-962f-f0eb9e68c409","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-8c03e14f-77fb-4af4-ba90-236271e47a1a","process_id":"49573","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh pr view 342 --json body,files,additions,deletions,headRefOid,baseRefOid; git -C /home/mike/nexus-code fetch origin refs/pull/342/head:refs/remotes/origin/pr/342 --quiet && git -C /home/mike/nexus-code diff --stat origin/main...origin/pr/342 && git -C /home/mike/nexus-code diff --check origin/main...origin/pr/342 && git -C /home/mike/nexus-code diff --unified=12 origin/main...origin/pr/342 -- .github/workflows/ci.yml .github/workflows/release.yml cli/test/release_workflow_parity.test.ts package.json cli/package.json core/Cargo.toml docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.14.md"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh pr view 342 --json body,files,additions,deletions,headRefOid,baseRefOid; git -C /home/mike/nexus-code fetch origin refs/pull/342/head:refs/remotes/origin/pr/342 --quiet && git -C /home/mike/nexus-code diff --stat origin/main...origin/pr/342 && git -C /home/mike/nexus-code diff --check origin/main...origin/pr/342 && git -C /home/mike/nexus-code diff --unified=12 origin/main...origin/pr/342 -- .github/workflows/ci.yml .github/workflows/release.yml cli/test/release_workflow_parity.test.ts package.json cli/package.json core/Cargo.toml docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.14.md"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\"additions\":53,\"baseRefOid\":\"d68695f3cb299c51959169d2373f7b924496486e\",\"body\":\"**Stacked on #335** (head d01b25cc). Review only `d01b25cc..f05b3d40`; once #335 merges, this diff shrinks to those two commits.\\n\\n## Why\\nRC13 (tag at 1acff700) didn't publish. Release run 41009328850 attempt 1:\\n- Tests 308 and 351 refused with `compiler exposure could not be checked; refusing qualification`, after about 330 ms each.\\n- The `eval_integrity` test process then didn't exit, so the CLI test step hung for 42+ minutes. Main's Node 22 CI also hung there for 73 minutes before it was cancelled.\\n\\n#335 fixes the scanner; this PR prevents hangs from running indefinitely and cuts the candidate.\\n\\n## Commits\\n1. **e50ee9b1:** `timeout-minutes: 45` on the CLI test step in both CI jobs and the release job. Normal runs take 12-20 minutes; GitHub's default is 6 hours. `release_workflow_parity.test.ts` now asserts the limit in every job: it fails with the limit removed from release.yml and passes with it.\\n2. **f05b3d40:** version-only 1.0.0-rc.14 via `sync-version.mjs`, plus notes. The rc.13 notes say it wasn't published. No product code has changed since the rc.12 tag.\\n\\n## Verification at f05b3d40\\n- `check_requirements.mjs --enforce`: exit 0\\n- `sync-version.mjs --check`: all components at 1.0.0-rc.14\\n- release_workflow_parity, node_floor, version_only_diff, install_durability: 10/10 pass\\n\\nNeeds an independent review (not claude-code) and exact-head green CI after rebasing onto main.\\n\\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\",\"deletions\":9,\"files\":[{\"path\":\".github/workflows/ci.yml\",\"additions\":8,\"deletions\":2,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\".github/workflows/release.yml\",\"additions\":4,\"deletions\":1,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"cli/package-lock.json\",\"additions\":2,\"deletions\":2,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"cli/package.json\",\"additions\":1,\"deletions\":1,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"cli/test/release_workflow_parity.test.ts\",\"additions\":1,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"core/Cargo.lock\",\"additions\":1,\"deletions\":1,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"core/Cargo.toml\",\"additions\":1,\"deletions\":1,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.13.md\",\"additions\":2,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.14.md\",\"additions\":32,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"ADDED\"},{\"path\":\"package.json\",\"additions\":1,\"deletions\":1,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"}],\"headRefOid\":\"26c1f541beb3d868e0c3e1604abf674e7aa05949\"}\n .github/workflows/ci.yml                 | 10 ++++++++--\n .github/workflows/release.yml            |  5 ++++-\n cli/package-lock.json                    |  4 ++--\n cli/package.json                         |  2 +-\n cli/test/release_workflow_parity.test.ts |  1 +\n core/Cargo.lock                          |  2 +-\n core/Cargo.toml                          |  2 +-\n docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.13.md            |  2 ++\n docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.14.md            | 32 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n package.json                             |  2 +-\n 10 files changed, 53 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)\ndiff --git a/.github/workflows/ci.yml b/.github/workflows/ci.yml\nindex 68537760..aecdb11a 100644\n--- a/.github/workflows/ci.yml\n+++ b/.github/workflows/ci.yml\n@@ -67,25 +67,28 @@ jobs:\n           CARGO_HOME=\"${CARGO_HOME:-$HOME/.cargo}\"\n           export CARGO_HOME\n           mkdir -p \"$CARGO_HOME/bin\"\n           echo \"$CARGO_HOME/bin\" >> \"$GITHUB_PATH\"\n           export PATH=\"$CARGO_HOME/bin:$PATH\"\n           cargo install cargo-audit --locked --version 0.22.2\n           curl -fsSL https://github.com/EmbarkStudios/cargo-deny/releases/download/0.20.2/cargo-deny-0.20.2-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz | tar -xz -C \"$RUNNER_TEMP\"\n           mv \"$RUNNER_TEMP/cargo-deny-0.20.2-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl/cargo-deny\" \"$CARGO_HOME/bin/\"\n           curl -fsSL https://github.com/CycloneDX/cyclonedx-rust-cargo/releases/download/cargo-cyclonedx-0.5.9/cargo-cyclonedx-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz | tar -xJ -C \"$RUNNER_TEMP\"\n           mv \"$RUNNER_TEMP/cargo-cyclonedx-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl/cargo-cyclonedx\" \"$CARGO_HOME/bin/\"\n           curl -fsSL https://github.com/CycloneDX/cyclonedx-cli/releases/download/v0.33.1/cyclonedx-linux-x64 -o \"$CARGO_HOME/bin/cyclonedx\"\n           chmod +x \"$CARGO_HOME/bin/cyclonedx\"\n-      - run: npm --prefix cli test\n+      - name: Run the CLI suite with a hang bound\n+        # Normal runs take 12-20 minutes; a test process that never exits must fail the job, not hold it for 6 hours.\n+        timeout-minutes: 45\n+        run: npm --prefix cli test\n \n   linux-x86_64:\n     needs: [test-matrix]\n     runs-on: ubuntu-22.04\n     env:\n       NEXUS_BUILD_CONTAINER_IMAGE: rust:1.95.0-bookworm@sha256:4c2fd73ef19c5ef9d54bee03b06b2839a392604fbfcd578ed948b71b37c1d7fb\n     steps:\n       - uses: actions/checkout@11d5960a326750d5838078e36cf38b85af677262 # v4\n       - run: sudo apt-get update && sudo apt-get install --yes acl make bubblewrap build-essential meson ninja-build pkg-config libcap-dev\n       - uses: actions/setup-go@40f1582b2485089dde7abd97c1529aa768e1baff # v5\n         with:\n           go-version: '1.22.12'\n@@ -136,25 +139,28 @@ jobs:\n           mv \"$RUNNER_TEMP/cargo-about-0.9.2-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl/cargo-about\" \"$CARGO_HOME/bin/\"\n           curl -fsSL https://github.com/CycloneDX/cyclonedx-rust-cargo/releases/download/cargo-cyclonedx-0.5.9/cargo-cyclonedx-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz | tar -xJ -C \"$RUNNER_TEMP\"\n           mv \"$RUNNER_TEMP/cargo-cyclonedx-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl/cargo-cyclonedx\" \"$CARGO_HOME/bin/\"\n           curl -fsSL https://github.com/CycloneDX/cyclonedx-cli/releases/download/v0.33.1/cyclonedx-linux-x64 -o \"$CARGO_HOME/bin/cyclonedx\"\n           chmod +x \"$CARGO_HOME/bin/cyclonedx\"\n       - run: cargo deny --manifest-path core/Cargo.toml --config deny.toml check licenses advisories\n       - run: node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check\n       - run: npm ci --prefix cli\n       - run: npm --prefix cli run build\n       - run: git diff --exit-code -- cli/dist\n       - run: cargo test --locked --manifest-path core/Cargo.toml\n       - run: cargo build --locked --release --manifest-path core/Cargo.toml --bin harness-core --bin nexus-tui\n-      - run: npm --prefix cli test\n+      - name: Run the CLI suite with a hang bound\n+        # Normal runs take 12-20 minutes; a test process that never exits must fail the job, not hold it for 6 hours.\n+        timeout-minutes: 45\n+        run: npm --prefix cli test\n       - run: bash scripts/security_gates.sh\n       - run: node scripts/check_requirements.mjs\n       - id: release-version\n         run: echo \"version=$(node -p 'require(\"./package.json\").version')\" >> \"$GITHUB_OUTPUT\"\n       - run: bash scripts/package-linux.sh \"v${{ steps.release-version.outputs.version }}\" \"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist\"\n       - run: bash scripts/package-linux.sh \"v${{ steps.release-version.outputs.version }}\" \"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check\"\n       - run: cmp \"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/nexus-linux-x86_64-v${{ steps.release-version.outputs.version }}.tar.gz\" \"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check/nexus-linux-x86_64-v${{ steps.release-version.outputs.version }}.tar.gz\"\n       - run: cmp \"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/SHA256SUMS\" \"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check/SHA256SUMS\"\n       - run: cmp \"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt\" \"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt\"\n       - run: cyclonedx validate --input-file \"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/sbom.cdx.json\" --fail-on-errors\n       - run: cmp \"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/sbom.cdx.json\" \"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check/sbom.cdx.json\"\n       - run: cmp \"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/install.sh\" \"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check/install.sh\"\ndiff --git a/.github/workflows/release.yml b/.github/workflows/release.yml\nindex f3cacd35..4ba4798a 100644\n--- a/.github/workflows/release.yml\n+++ b/.github/workflows/release.yml\n@@ -92,25 +92,28 @@ jobs:\n         if: ${{ !contains(github.ref_name, '-') }}\n         # The checkout has full history and tags (fetch-depth: 0). The checker runs from the RC's own copy so a stable\n         # commit cannot replace it; branch and tag protection remain the control over the workflow file itself.\n         run: |\n           rc=\"$(git tag --points-at \"$GITHUB_SHA^\" | grep -E \"^${GITHUB_REF_NAME//./\\\\.}-rc\\.[0-9]+$\" | sort -V | tail -n 1 || true)\"\n           test -n \"$rc\" || { echo \"the parent of $GITHUB_REF_NAME is not a ${GITHUB_REF_NAME}-rc.N tag\" >&2; exit 1; }\n           git show \"$rc:scripts/check-version-only-diff.mjs\" > \"$RUNNER_TEMP/check-version-only-diff.mjs\"\n           node \"$RUNNER_TEMP/check-version-only-diff.mjs\" \"$rc\" \"$GITHUB_SHA\"\n       - run: npm ci --prefix cli\n       - run: npm --prefix cli run build\n       - run: cargo test --locked --manifest-path core/Cargo.toml\n       - run: cargo build --locked --release --manifest-path core/Cargo.toml --bin harness-core --bin nexus-tui\n-      - run: npm --prefix cli test\n+      - name: Run the CLI suite with a hang bound\n+        # Normal runs take 12-20 minutes; a test process that never exits must fail the job, not hold it for 6 hours.\n+        timeout-minutes: 45\n+        run: npm --prefix cli test\n       - run: bash scripts/security_gates.sh\n       - run: bash scripts/package-linux.sh \"$GITHUB_REF_NAME\" \"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist\"\n       - run: bash scripts/package-linux.sh \"$GITHUB_REF_NAME\" \"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check\"\n       - run: cmp \"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/nexus-linux-x86_64-$GITHUB_REF_NAME.tar.gz\" \"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check/nexus-linux-x86_64-$GITHUB_REF_NAME.tar.gz\"\n       - run: cmp \"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/SHA256SUMS\" \"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check/SHA256SUMS\"\n       - run: cmp \"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt\" \"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt\"\n       - run: cyclonedx validate --input-file \"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/sbom.cdx.json\" --fail-on-errors\n       - run: cmp \"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/sbom.cdx.json\" \"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check/sbom.cdx.json\"\n       - run: cmp \"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/install.sh\" \"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check/install.sh\"\n       - run: bash scripts/smoke-package.sh \"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/nexus-linux-x86_64-$GITHUB_REF_NAME.tar.gz\"\n       - run: bash scripts/installer-smoke.sh \"$GITHUB_WORKSPACE/install.sh\" \"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/nexus-linux-x86_64-$GITHUB_REF_NAME.tar.gz\"\n       - name: Attest build provenance\ndiff --git a/cli/package.json b/cli/package.json\nindex da58c532..3d74b009 100644\n--- a/cli/package.json\n+++ b/cli/package.json\n@@ -1,15 +1,15 @@\n {\n   \"name\": \"local-code-harness\",\n-  \"version\": \"1.0.0-rc.13\",\n+  \"version\": \"1.0.0-rc.14\",\n   \"type\": \"module\",\n   \"description\": \"Autonomous local AI coding harness (Codex / Claude-Code style) for LM Studio and vLLM\",\n   \"main\": \"dist/index.js\",\n   \"bin\": {\n     \"harness\": \"./dist/index.js\"\n   },\n   \"scripts\": {\n     \"build\": \"tsc && node scripts/write_build_info.mjs\",\n     \"test\": \"node scripts/run_tests.mjs && bash ../scripts/terminal-acceptance/test-scope-procs.sh\",\n     \"start\": \"node dist/index.js\",\n     \"dev\": \"tsx watch src/index.ts\"\n   },\ndiff --git a/cli/test/release_workflow_parity.test.ts b/cli/test/release_workflow_parity.test.ts\nindex 8c1a9502..9a057db5 100644\n--- a/cli/test/release_workflow_parity.test.ts\n+++ b/cli/test/release_workflow_parity.test.ts\n@@ -38,23 +38,24 @@ test(\"release job prepares the same evaluator environment as CI before running t\n     [\"CI Node matrix\", jobSection(ci, \"test-matrix\")],\n     [\"CI Linux packaging\", jobSection(ci, \"linux-x86_64\")],\n     [\"release package\", jobSection(release, \"package\")],\n   ] as const;\n \n   for (const [jobName, job] of jobs) {\n     assert.ok(\n       !job.includes(RETIRED_RUNNER_TRIM_STEP),\n       `${jobName} does not invoke the retired runner trim script`,\n     );\n     const suite = job.indexOf(\"run: npm --prefix cli test\");\n     assert.ok(suite >= 0, `${jobName} runs the CLI suite`);\n+    assert.match(job, /timeout-minutes: \\d+\\n\\s+run: npm --prefix cli test/, `${jobName} bounds the CLI suite so a hung test process fails the job`);\n     const positions = REQUIRED_EVALUATOR_SETUP.map((step) => {\n       const position = job.indexOf(step);\n       assert.ok(position >= 0, `${jobName} includes required evaluator setup: ${step}`);\n       assert.ok(position < suite, `${jobName} runs evaluator setup before the CLI suite: ${step}`);\n       return position;\n     });\n     for (let index = 1; index < positions.length; index += 1) {\n       assert.ok(positions[index - 1] < positions[index], `${jobName} preserves evaluator setup order`);\n     }\n   }\n });\ndiff --git a/core/Cargo.toml b/core/Cargo.toml\nindex 73a9daaf..5192fada 100644\n--- a/core/Cargo.toml\n+++ b/core/Cargo.toml\n@@ -1,15 +1,15 @@\n [package]\n name = \"harness-core\"\n-version = \"1.0.0-rc.13\"\n+version = \"1.0.0-rc.14\"\n edition = \"2024\"\n rust-version = \"1.85.0\"\n license = \"Apache-2.0\"\n \n [[bin]]\n name = \"harness-core\"\n path = \"src/main.rs\"\n \n [[bin]]\n name = \"nexus-tui\"\n path = \"src/bin/nexus_tui.rs\"\n \ndiff --git a/docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.14.md b/docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.14.md\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 00000000..75f1e75e\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.14.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,32 @@\n+# Nexus Code v1.0.0-rc.14 release candidate\n+\n+**Maturity:** release candidate; prerelease, not stable.\n+\n+**Status:** this candidate is for exact-artifact qualification. It does not establish independent acceptance or authorize stable v1.0.0 promotion. Qualification results must identify the workflow-produced package and its digest.\n+\n+This release packages the Nexus Code Linux x86-64 client: the TypeScript CLI and sidecar, production Node dependencies, Rust `harness-core`, and Ratatui `nexus-tui`. It replaces RC12 and RC13, which were tagged but never published: both release workflows failed in the test step, so neither package exists. RC14 ships the same product changes as RC12; everything in the [RC13](v1.0.0-rc.13.md), [RC12](v1.0.0-rc.12.md) and [RC11](v1.0.0-rc.11.md) notes is included.\n+\n+## Changes since RC13\n+\n+### Qualification tooling and release workflow (not in the package)\n+\n+- The evaluator's compiler-exposure check no longer depends on deleting the hosted runner's preinstalled SDK trees. It masks host-only SDK directories inside the candidate sandbox under every mounted spelling, ignores an inventoried path only when it has been removed before inspection, and names the cause when its inventory helper fails (timeout, kill, nonzero exit or unexpected output). Every other inspection error still refuses qualification. RC13's release run failed when this check refused in two evaluator tests.\n+- The CLI test step in the release and CI workflows now has a 45-minute limit. RC13's release run and a main CI run stalled after the evaluator test file finished, because its test process did not exit; a hung step now fails the job instead of running for six hours. The limit bounds the damage; the cause of the non-exiting test process has not been identified.\n+\n+No product code changed between RC12's tag and RC14.\n+\n+## Runtime requirements\n+\n+- Linux x86-64 with glibc 2.35 or newer.\n+- Node.js 22 or newer.\n+- An OpenAI-compatible inference endpoint, local or explicitly selected provider.\n+\n+The archive does not include Node.js. Rust and Cargo are not required at runtime. No other OS or architecture is claimed.\n+\n+## Candidate assets\n+\n+The release workflow for `v1.0.0-rc.14` is expected to produce the version-matched Linux archive, `SHA256SUMS`, SBOM, notices, installer, and provenance. The workflow run, tag commit, artifact digests, and qualification evidence must be recorded before this candidate can be accepted. Local builds are not interchangeable with the workflow-produced artifacts.\n+\n+## Qualification status\n+\n+This is a candidate, not an accepted release. The installed-RC gates — platform and lifecycle evidence including the power-loss cell, mandatory automated CI PTY (§5.1) and scripted installed-RC PTY (§5.2), provider and standalone qualification, held-out task quality, cross-runner reproducibility, independent exact-RC acceptance and the requirements ledger — remain outstanding for this artifact. RC11 evidence does not carry over to RC14 without an explicit, reviewed carry-forward. The manual matrix (§5.3) is waived for v1.0.0 by DEC-20; this does not waive steering, accessibility, or any other release gate. Passing source CI does not satisfy installed-RC qualification.\ndiff --git a/package.json b/package.json\nindex 4464f18e..3fe81f01 100644\n--- a/package.json\n+++ b/package.json\n@@ -1,15 +1,15 @@\n {\n   \"name\": \"nexus-code-harness\",\n-  \"version\": \"1.0.0-rc.13\",\n+  \"version\": \"1.0.0-rc.14\",\n   \"description\": \"High-Performance Autonomous Local AI Coding Harness (Codex / Claude-Code style) powered by Rust + TypeScript\",\n   \"scripts\": {\n     \"build:core\": \"cargo build --release --manifest-path core/Cargo.toml\",\n     \"build:cli\": \"npm --prefix cli run build\",\n     \"build\": \"npm run build:core && npm run build:cli\",\n     \"install:cli\": \"npm --prefix cli install\",\n     \"setup\": \"npm run install:cli && npm run build\",\n     \"harness\": \"node cli/dist/index.js\",\n     \"check\": \"node cli/dist/index.js check\",\n     \"models\": \"node cli/dist/index.js models\",\n     \"security-scan\": \"bash scripts/security_gates.sh\",\n     \"audit\": \"npm --prefix cli audit\",\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":204978910}},"started_at_ms":1793344913517,"completed_at_ms":1793344914724}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-30T07:22:03.343Z","ordinal":522007,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a18baf-e6cf-7392-ac5c-408ba0358249","call_id":"call_24da878611a748a1b1df236865729bbb","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 10.4 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"i\":0,\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":{\"chunk_id\":\"296ef5\",\"wall_time_seconds\":10.001651901,\"session_id\":9229,\"original_token_count\":0,\"output\":\"\"}}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"i\":1,\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":{\"chunk_id\":\"e882a3\",\"wall_time_seconds\":1.204748511,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":4296,\"output\":\"Warning: truncated output (original token count: 4296)\\nTotal output lines: 240\\n\\n{\\\"additions\\\":53,\\\"baseRefOid\\\":\\\"d68695f3cb299c51959169d2373f7b924496486e\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"**Stacked on #335** (head d01b25cc). Review only `d01b25cc..f05b3d40`; once #335 merges, this diff shrinks to those two commits.\\\\n\\\\n## Why\\\\nRC13 (tag at 1acff700) didn't publish. Release run 41009328850 attempt 1:\\\\n- Tests 308 and 351 refused with `compiler exposure could not be checked; refusing qualification`, after about 330 ms each.\\\\n- The `eval_integrity` test process then didn't exit, so the CLI test step hung for 42+ minutes. Main's Node 22 CI also hung there for 73 minutes before it was cancelled.\\\\n\\\\n#335 fixes the scanner; this PR prevents hangs from running indefinitely and cuts the candidate.\\\\n\\\\n## Commits\\\\n1. **e50ee9b1:** `timeout-minutes: 45` on the CLI test step in both CI jobs and the release job. Normal runs take 12-20 minutes; GitHub's default is 6 hours. `release_workflow_parity.test.ts` now asserts the limit in every job: it fails with the limit removed from release.yml and passes with it.\\\\n2. **f05b3d40:** version-only 1.0.0-rc.14 via `sync-version.mjs`, plus notes. The rc.13 notes say it wasn't published. No product code has changed since the rc.12 tag.\\\\n\\\\n## Verification at f05b3d40\\\\n- `check_requirements.mjs --enforce`: exit 0\\\\n- `sync-version.mjs --check`: all components at 1.0.0-rc.14\\\\n- release_workflow_parity, node_floor, version_only_diff, install_durability: 10/10 pass\\\\n\\\\nNeeds an independent review (not claude-code) and exact-head green CI after rebasing onto main.\\\\n\\\\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\\\",\\\"deletions\\\":9,\\\"files\\\":[{\\\"path\\\":\\\".github/workflows/ci.yml\\\",\\\"additions\\\":8,\\\"deletions\\\":2,\\\"changeType\\\":\\\"MODIFIED\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\".github/workflows/release.yml\\\",\\\"additions\\\":4,\\\"deletions\\\":1,\\\"changeType\\\":\\\"MODIFIED\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"cli/package-lock.json\\\",\\\"additions\\\":2,\\\"deletions\\\":2,\\\"changeType\\\":\\\"MODIFIED\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"cli/package.json\\\",\\\"additions\\\":1,\\\"deletions\\\":1,\\\"changeType\\\":\\\"MODIFIED\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"cli/test/release_workflow_parity.test.ts\\\",\\\"additions\\\":1,\\\"deletions\\\":0,\\\"changeType\\\":\\\"MODIFIED\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"core/Cargo.lock\\\",\\\"additions\\\":1,\\\"deletions\\\":1,\\\"changeType\\\":\\\"MODIFIED\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"core/Cargo.toml\\\",\\\"additions\\\":1,\\\"deletions\\\":1,\\\"changeType\\\":\\\"MODIFIED\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.13.md\\\",\\\"additions\\\":2,\\\"deletions\\\":0,\\\"changeType\\\":\\\"MODIFIED\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.14.md\\\",\\\"additions\\\":32,\\\"deletions\\\":0,\\\"changeType\\\":\\\"ADDED\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"package.json\\\",\\\"additions\\\":1,\\\"deletions\\\":1,\\\"changeType\\\":\\\"MODIFIED\\\"}],\\\"headRefOid\\\":\\\"26c1f541beb3d868e0c3e1604abf674e7aa05949\\\"}\\n .github/workflows/ci.yml                 | 10 ++++++++--\\n .github/workflows/release.yml            |  5 ++++-\\n cli/package-lock.json                    |  4 ++--\\n cli/package.json                         |  2 +-\\n cli/test/release_workflow_parity.test.ts |  1 +\\n core/Cargo.lock                          |  2 +-\\n core/Cargo.toml                          |  2 +-\\n docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.13.md            |  2 ++\\n docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.14.md            | 32 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\\n package.json                             |  2 +-\\n 10 files changed, 53 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)\\ndiff --git a/.github/workflows/ci.yml b/.github/workflows/ci.yml\\nindex 68537760..aecdb11a 100644\\n--- a/.github/workflows/ci.yml\\n+++ b/.github/workflows/ci.yml\\n@@ -67,25 +67,28 @@ jobs:\\n           CARGO_HOME=\\\"${CARGO_HOME:-$HOME/.cargo}\\\"\\n           export CARGO_HOME\\n           mkdir -p \\\"$CARGO_HOME/bin\\\"\\n           echo \\\"$CARGO_HOME/bin\\\" >> \\\"$GITHUB_PATH\\\"\\n           export PATH=\\\"$CARGO_HOME/bin:$PATH\\\"\\n           cargo install cargo-audit --locked --version 0.22.2\\n           curl -fsSL https://github.com/EmbarkStudios/cargo-deny/releases/download/0.20.2/cargo-deny-0.20.2-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz | tar -xz -C \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP\\\"\\n           mv \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/cargo-deny-0.20.2-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl/cargo-deny\\\" \\\"$CARGO_HOME/bin/\\\"\\n           curl -fsSL https://github.com/CycloneDX/cyclonedx-rust-cargo/releases/download/cargo-cyclonedx-0.5.9/cargo-cyclonedx-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz | tar -xJ -C \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP\\\"\\n           mv \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/cargo-cyclonedx-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl/cargo-cyclonedx\\\" \\\"$CARGO_HOME/bin/\\\"\\n           curl -fsSL https://github.com/CycloneDX/cyclonedx-cli/releases/download/v0.33.1/cyclonedx-linux-x64 -o \\\"$CARGO_HOME/bin/cyclonedx\\\"\\n           chmod +x \\\"$CARGO_HOME/bin/cyclonedx\\\"\\n-      - run: npm --prefix cli test\\n+      - name: Run the CLI suite with a hang bound\\n+        # Normal runs take 12-20 minutes; a test process that never exits must fail the job, not hold it for 6 hours.\\n+        timeout-minutes: 45\\n+        run: npm --prefix cli test\\n \\n   linux-x86_64:\\n     needs: [test-matrix]\\n     runs-on: ubuntu-22.04\\n     env:\\n       NEXUS_BUILD_CONTAINER_IMAGE: rust:1.95.0-bookworm@sha256:4c2fd73ef19c5ef9d54bee03b06b2839a392604fbfcd578ed948b71b37c1d7fb\\n     steps:\\n       - uses: actions/checkout@11d5960a326750d5838078e36cf38b85af677262 # v4\\n       - run: sudo apt-get update && sudo apt-get install --yes acl make bubblewrap build-essential meson ninja-build pkg-config libcap-dev\\n       - uses: actions/setup-go@40f1582b2485089dde7abd97c1529aa768e1baff # v5\\n         with:\\n           go-version: '1.22.12'\\n@@ -136,25 +139,28 @@ jobs:\\n           mv \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/cargo-about-0.9.2-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl/cargo-about\\\" \\\"$CARGO_HOME/bin/\\\"\\n           curl -fsSL https://github.com/CycloneDX/cyclonedx-rust-cargo/releases/download/cargo-cyclonedx-0.5.9/cargo-cyclonedx-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz | tar -xJ -C \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP\\\"\\n           mv \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/cargo-cyclonedx-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl/cargo-cyclonedx\\\" \\\"$CARGO_HOME/bin/\\\"\\n           curl -fsSL https://github.com/CycloneDX/cyclonedx-cli/releases/download/v0.33.1/cyclonedx-linux-x64 -o \\\"$CARGO_HOME/bin/cyclonedx\\\"\\n           chmod +x \\\"$CARGO_HOME/bin/cyclonedx\\\"\\n       - run: cargo deny --manifest-path core/Cargo.toml --config deny.toml check licenses advisories\\n       - run: node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check\\n       - run: npm ci --prefix cli\\n       - run: npm --prefix cli run build\\n       - run: git diff --exit-code -- cli/dist\\n       - run: cargo test --locked --manifest-path core/Cargo.toml\\n       - run: cargo build --locked --release --manifest-path core/Cargo.toml --bin harness-core --bin nexus-tui\\n-      - run: npm --prefix cli test\\n+      - name: Run the CLI suite with a hang bound\\n+        # Normal runs take 12-20 minutes; a test process that never exits must fail the job, not hold it for 6 hours.\\n+        timeout-minutes: 45\\n+        run: npm --prefix cli test\\n       - run: bash scripts/security_gates.sh\\n       - run: node scripts/check_requirements.mjs\\n       - id: release-version\\n         run: echo \\\"version=$(node -p 'require(\\\"./package.json\\\").version')\\\" >> \\\"$GITHUB_OUTPUT\\\"\\n       - run: bash scripts/package-linux.sh \\\"v${{ steps.release-version.outputs.version }}\\\" \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist\\\"\\n       - run: bash scripts/package-linux.sh \\\"v${{ steps.release-version.outputs.version }}\\\" \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check\\\"\\n       - run: cmp \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/nexus-linux-x86_64-v${{ steps.release-version.outputs.version }}.tar.gz\\\" \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check/nexus-linux-x86_64-v${{ steps.release-version.outputs.version }}.tar.gz\\\"\\n       - run: cmp \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/SHA256SUMS\\\" \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check/SHA256SUMS\\\"\\n       - run: cmp \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt\\\" \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt\\\"\\n       - run: cyclonedx validate --input-file \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/sbom.cdx.json\\\" --fail-on-errors\\n       - run: cmp \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/sbom.cdx.json\\\" \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check/sbom.cdx.json\\\"\\n       - run: cmp \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/install.sh\\\" \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check/install.sh\\\"\\ndiff --git a/.github/workflows/release.yml b/.github/workflows/release.yml\\nindex f3cacd35..4ba4798a 100644\\n--- a/.github/workflows/release.yml\\n+++ b/.github/workflows/release.yml\\n@@ -92,25 +92,28 @@ jobs:\\n         if: ${{ !contains(github.ref_name, '-') }}\\n         # The checkout has full history and tags (fetch-depth: 0). The checker runs from …296 tokens truncated…: bash scripts/package-linux.sh \\\"$GITHUB_REF_NAME\\\" \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist\\\"\\n       - run: bash scripts/package-linux.sh \\\"$GITHUB_REF_NAME\\\" \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check\\\"\\n       - run: cmp \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/nexus-linux-x86_64-$GITHUB_REF_NAME.tar.gz\\\" \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check/nexus-linux-x86_64-$GITHUB_REF_NAME.tar.gz\\\"\\n       - run: cmp \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/SHA256SUMS\\\" \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check/SHA256SUMS\\\"\\n       - run: cmp \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt\\\" \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt\\\"\\n       - run: cyclonedx validate --input-file \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/sbom.cdx.json\\\" --fail-on-errors\\n       - run: cmp \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/sbom.cdx.json\\\" \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check/sbom.cdx.json\\\"\\n       - run: cmp \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/install.sh\\\" \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/repro-check/install.sh\\\"\\n       - run: bash scripts/smoke-package.sh \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/nexus-linux-x86_64-$GITHUB_REF_NAME.tar.gz\\\"\\n       - run: bash scripts/installer-smoke.sh \\\"$GITHUB_WORKSPACE/install.sh\\\" \\\"$RUNNER_TEMP/dist/nexus-linux-x86_64-$GITHUB_REF_NAME.tar.gz\\\"\\n       - name: Attest build provenance\\ndiff --git a/cli/package.json b/cli/package.json\\nindex da58c532..3d74b009 100644\\n--- a/cli/package.json\\n+++ b/cli/package.json\\n@@ -1,15 +1,15 @@\\n {\\n   \\\"name\\\": \\\"local-code-harness\\\",\\n-  \\\"version\\\": \\\"1.0.0-rc.13\\\",\\n+  \\\"version\\\": \\\"1.0.0-rc.14\\\",\\n   \\\"type\\\": \\\"module\\\",\\n   \\\"description\\\": \\\"Autonomous local AI coding harness (Codex / Claude-Code style) for LM Studio and vLLM\\\",\\n   \\\"main\\\": \\\"dist/index.js\\\",\\n   \\\"bin\\\": {\\n     \\\"harness\\\": \\\"./dist/index.js\\\"\\n   },\\n   \\\"scripts\\\": {\\n     \\\"build\\\": \\\"tsc && node scripts/write_build_info.mjs\\\",\\n     \\\"test\\\": \\\"node scripts/run_tests.mjs && bash ../scripts/terminal-acceptance/test-scope-procs.sh\\\",\\n     \\\"start\\\": \\\"node dist/index.js\\\",\\n     \\\"dev\\\": \\\"tsx watch src/index.ts\\\"\\n   },\\ndiff --git a/cli/test/release_workflow_parity.test.ts b/cli/test/release_workflow_parity.test.ts\\nindex 8c1a9502..9a057db5 100644\\n--- a/cli/test/release_workflow_parity.test.ts\\n+++ b/cli/test/release_workflow_parity.test.ts\\n@@ -38,23 +38,24 @@ test(\\\"release job prepares the same evaluator environment as CI before running t\\n     [\\\"CI Node matrix\\\", jobSection(ci, \\\"test-matrix\\\")],\\n     [\\\"CI Linux packaging\\\", jobSection(ci, \\\"linux-x86_64\\\")],\\n     [\\\"release package\\\", jobSection(release, \\\"package\\\")],\\n   ] as const;\\n \\n   for (const [jobName, job] of jobs) {\\n     assert.ok(\\n       !job.includes(RETIRED_RUNNER_TRIM_STEP),\\n       `${jobName} does not invoke the retired runner trim script`,\\n     );\\n     const suite = job.indexOf(\\\"run: npm --prefix cli test\\\");\\n     assert.ok(suite >= 0, `${jobName} runs the CLI suite`);\\n+    assert.match(job, /timeout-minutes: \\\\d+\\\\n\\\\s+run: npm --prefix cli test/, `${jobName} bounds the CLI suite so a hung test process fails the job`);\\n     const positions = REQUIRED_EVALUATOR_SETUP.map((step) => {\\n       const position = job.indexOf(step);\\n       assert.ok(position >= 0, `${jobName} includes required evaluator setup: ${step}`);\\n       assert.ok(position < suite, `${jobName} runs evaluator setup before the CLI suite: ${step}`);\\n       return position;\\n     });\\n     for (let index = 1; index < positions.length; index += 1) {\\n       assert.ok(positions[index - 1] < positions[index], `${jobName} preserves evaluator setup order`);\\n     }\\n   }\\n });\\ndiff --git a/core/Cargo.toml b/core/Cargo.toml\\nindex 73a9daaf..5192fada 100644\\n--- a/core/Cargo.toml\\n+++ b/core/Cargo.toml\\n@@ -1,15 +1,15 @@\\n [package]\\n name = \\\"harness-core\\\"\\n-version = \\\"1.0.0-rc.13\\\"\\n+version = \\\"1.0.0-rc.14\\\"\\n edition = \\\"2024\\\"\\n rust-version = \\\"1.85.0\\\"\\n license = \\\"Apache-2.0\\\"\\n \\n [[bin]]\\n name = \\\"harness-core\\\"\\n path = \\\"src/main.rs\\\"\\n \\n [[bin]]\\n name = \\\"nexus-tui\\\"\\n path = \\\"src/bin/nexus_tui.rs\\\"\\n \\ndiff --git a/docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.14.md b/docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.14.md\\nnew file mode 100644\\nindex 00000000..75f1e75e\\n--- /dev/null\\n+++ b/docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.14.md\\n@@ -0,0 +1,32 @@\\n+# Nexus Code v1.0.0-rc.14 release candidate\\n+\\n+**Maturity:** release candidate; prerelease, not stable.\\n+\\n+**Status:** this candidate is for exact-artifact qualification. It does not establish independent acceptance or authorize stable v1.0.0 promotion. Qualification results must identify the workflow-produced package and its digest.\\n+\\n+This release packages the Nexus Code Linux x86-64 client: the TypeScript CLI and sidecar, production Node dependencies, Rust `harness-core`, and Ratatui `nexus-tui`. It replaces RC12 and RC13, which were tagged but never published: both release workflows failed in the test step, so neither package exists. RC14 ships the same product changes as RC12; everything in the [RC13](v1.0.0-rc.13.md), [RC12](v1.0.0-rc.12.md) and [RC11](v1.0.0-rc.11.md) notes is included.\\n+\\n+## Changes since RC13\\n+\\n+### Qualification tooling and release workflow (not in the package)\\n+\\n+- The evaluator's compiler-exposure check no longer depends on deleting the hosted runner's preinstalled SDK trees. It masks host-only SDK directories inside the candidate sandbox under every mounted spelling, ignores an inventoried path only when it has been removed before inspection, and names the cause when its inventory helper fails (timeout, kill, nonzero exit or unexpected output). Every other inspection error still refuses qualification. RC13's release run failed when this check refused in two evaluator tests.\\n+- The CLI test step in the release and CI workflows now has a 45-minute limit. RC13's release run and a main CI run stalled after the evaluator test file finished, because its test process did not exit; a hung step now fails the job instead of running for six hours. The limit bounds the damage; the cause of the non-exiting test process has not been identified.\\n+\\n+No product code changed between RC12's tag and RC14.\\n+\\n+## Runtime requirements\\n+\\n+- Linux x86-64 with glibc 2.35 or newer.\\n+- Node.js 22 or newer.\\n+- An OpenAI-compatible inference endpoint, local or explicitly selected provider.\\n+\\n+The archive does not include Node.js. Rust and Cargo are not required at runtime. No other OS or architecture is claimed.\\n+\\n+## Candidate assets\\n+\\n+The release workflow for `v1.0.0-rc.14` is expected to produce the version-matched Linux archive, `SHA256SUMS`, SBOM, notices, installer, and provenance. The workflow run, tag commit, artifact digests, and qualification evidence must be recorded before this candidate can be accepted. Local builds are not interchangeable with the workflow-produced artifacts.\\n+\\n+## Qualification status\\n+\\n+This is a candidate, not an accepted release. The installed-RC gates — platform and lifecycle evidence including the power-loss cell, mandatory automated CI PTY (§5.1) and scripted installed-RC PTY (§5.2), provider and standalone qualification, held-out task quality, cross-runner reproducibility, independent exact-RC acceptance and the requirements ledger — remain outstanding for this artifact. RC11 evidence does not carry over to RC14 without an explicit, reviewed carry-forward. The manual matrix (§5.3) is waived for v1.0.0 by DEC-20; this does not waive steering, accessibility, or any other release gate. Passing source CI does not satisfy installed-RC qualification.\\ndiff --git a/package.json b/package.json\\nindex 4464f18e..3fe81f01 100644\\n--- a/package.json\\n+++ b/package.json\\n@@ -1,15 +1,15 @@\\n {\\n   \\\"name\\\": \\\"nexus-code-harness\\\",\\n-  \\\"version\\\": \\\"1.0.0-rc.13\\\",\\n+  \\\"version\\\": \\\"1.0.0-rc.14\\\",\\n   \\\"description\\\": \\\"High-Performance Autonomous Local AI Coding Harness (Codex / Claude-Code style) powered by Rust + TypeScript\\\",\\n   \\\"scripts\\\": {\\n     \\\"build:core\\\": \\\"cargo build --release --manifest-path core/Cargo.toml\\\",\\n     \\\"build:cli\\\": \\\"npm --prefix cli run build\\\",\\n     \\\"build\\\": \\\"npm run build:core && npm run build:cli\\\",\\n     \\\"install:cli\\\": \\\"npm --prefix cli install\\\",\\n     \\\"setup\\\": \\\"npm run install:cli && npm run build\\\",\\n     \\\"harness\\\": \\\"node cli/dist/index.js\\\",\\n     \\\"check\\\": \\\"node cli/dist/index.js check\\\",\\n     \\\"models\\\": \\\"node cli/dist/index.js models\\\",\\n     \\\"security-scan\\\": \\\"bash scripts/security_gates.sh\\\",\\n     \\\"audit\\\": \\\"npm --prefix cli audit\\\",\\n\"}}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"i\":2,\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":{\"chunk_id\":\"157944\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.16744421,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":530,\"output\":\"--- .git/nexus-claims/CUSTODY_T2_BLACKBOX_CONVERSION/owner.json\\n{\\n  \\\"agent\\\": \\\"opencode\\\",\\n  \\\"branch\\\": null,\\n  \\\"worktree\\\": null,\\n  \\\"since\\\": \\\"2026-10-29T02:24:10Z\\\"\\n}\\n--- .git/nexus-claims/RELEASE_PUBLISHER/owner.json\\n{\\n  \\\"agent\\\": \\\"/root\\\",\\n  \\\"host\\\": \\\"mike-dev\\\",\\n  \\\"branch\\\": \\\"v1/rc9-credential-origin-binding\\\",\\n  \\\"worktree\\\": \\\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc7-version-bump\\\",\\n  \\\"base\\\": \\\"d68695f3cb299c51959169d2373f7b924496486e\\\",\\n  \\\"head\\\": \\\"cfee7f561540b5e9e02f03f540614c5efcdb4b35\\\",\\n  \\\"scope\\\": \\\"Release publisher owns RC lifecycle and exact-source/artifact acceptance coordination; no held-out access, no stable publication until every release gate passes.\\\",\\n  \\\"status\\\": \\\"Current exact main d68695f3 includes PR335. Requirements enforcement PASS (123 rows, 12 exact-RC deferrals) and sync-version --check --tag v1.0.0-rc.13 PASS on clean worktree. Exact PR335 CI (Node22/24/Linux package/repro/smoke, CodeQL, JS/TS) PASS; post-merge main CI 41019427932 and CodeQL 41019427930 running. RC13 tag remains old source 1acff700 and its release attempt was cancelled without assets; latest public RC remains RC11. No accepted RC or stable release. Authorization remains granted but gated by exact-RC qualification and acceptance.\\\",\\n  \\\"updated_at\\\": \\\"2026-10-30T07:20:44+00:00\\\"\\n}\\n--- .git/nexus-claims/SUITE/owner.json\\n{\\n  \\\"agent\\\": \\\"codex-root\\\",\\n  \\\"host\\\": \\\"mike-dev\\\",\\n  \\\"branch\\\": \\\"origin/main-post-pr335-validation\\\",\\n  \\\"worktree\\\": \\\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/post-pr335-source-gates-20261030T0720Z\\\",\\n  \\\"base\\\": \\\"d68695f3cb299c51959169d2373f7b924496486e\\\",\\n  \\\"head\\\": \\\"d68695f3cb299c51959169d2373f7b924496486e\\\",\\n  \\\"since\\\": \\\"2026-10-30T07:20:44+00:00\\\",\\n  \\\"scope\\\": \\\"Coordinate exact-head validation on PR335 correction d01b25cc while monitoring already-active main CI 41009312010 and RC13 release 41009328850; no local full suite, only required hosted exact-head suite.\\\",\\n  \\\"status\\\": \\\"active; PR335 exact-head full suites and Linux package/repro/smoke all PASS in run 41014835061; PR335 merged by repository owner as d68695f3 at 07:19:53Z; post-merge main CI 41019427932 and CodeQL 41019427930 are running on exact main. No local suite or held-out run.\\\"\\n}\\n\"}}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18b8d-60e7-7130-962f-f0eb9e68c409","create_time":1793344923.3434083}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
