{"timestamp":"2026-10-30T07:22:37.915Z","ordinal":522050,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18b8d-60e7-7130-962f-f0eb9e68c409","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-1eea0b7e-fbfa-4c64-b921-23d692fea061","process_id":"80954","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh issue view 1 --json number,title,state,updatedAt,comments,url --jq '{number,title,state,updatedAt,url,comments:(.comments|map({author:.author.login,createdAt,body})|.[-5:])}'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh issue view 1 --json number,title,state,updatedAt,comments,url --jq '{number,title,state,updatedAt,url,comments:(.comments|map({author:.author.login,createdAt,body})|.[-5:])}'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\"comments\":[{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Release coordinator status request (2026-10-29; public metadata only; no private corpus material accessed): the latest custody claim metadata reports 20/40 T2 tasks built and no fresh T2 custody acceptance. T3 metadata is reported 8/8, but fresh custody acceptance remains unverified. The current integration is `fe1c91dbcb56693a34c06dd3719bea139f639833`; no held-out qualification has started.\\n\\nPlease have the designated custodian acknowledge the current owner and provide a metadata-only progress update. To unblock the release, either complete the remaining task authoring and custodian-only validation, or explicitly hand off the custody claim to an independent custodian who can do so. Do not post payloads, hidden answers, private validators, author logs, or sensitive digests here. No changes to the sealed corpus are authorized through this status request.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T17:35:39Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Custody coordination update (public metadata only; no payloads or private validators accessed).\\n\\nThe local SUITE lane is now released after the focused evaluator checks completed. The custody claim metadata still says T2 revalidation is waiting on SUITE. Please resume the custodian-only validation through the approved custody path and provide a status-only update on whether the T2 compatibility issue is resolved and what remains before custody acceptance. If the current owner cannot continue, please explicitly release or transfer the claim at a safe boundary and identify the reachable successor.\\n\\nNo held-out qualification has started. Please keep task contents, hidden answers, validator data, author logs, and private digests out of this issue.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T22:00:05Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Public-only coordinator follow-up: the historical custody report identifies the opencode primary session as T2 custodian, and the current local custody claim still names opencode with successor revalidation waiting on SUITE. SUITE has now completed and been released. Please acknowledge the active custodian and provide a status-only update, or explicitly release/transfer the custody claim at a safe boundary. The current successor corpus still needs fresh compatibility validation and written custody acceptance; the historical 40-task manifest does not establish that. Keep task payloads, hidden validators/answers, author logs, and private digests off this issue.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T22:23:59Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Coordinator follow-up (2026-10-29; public metadata only; no corpus payloads or validators accessed).\\n\\nKimi is unavailable until Nov 24, so I have taken over the public coordination lane. The protected custody claim still belongs to the custodian and has not been broken or accessed. The last public status is 20/40 T2 tasks, with no fresh custody acceptance.\\n\\nPlease provide a status-only update at a safe boundary:\\n1. Is the 40-task successor corpus complete, and is its blackbox-v1 compatibility validation complete?\\n2. Has the custodian verified setup/reference validation, custody separation, permissions, and integrity for the exact public manifest?\\n3. What remains before the custodian can accept and seal it, and can this work proceed now that the local SUITE lane is released?\\n4. If the current custodian cannot continue, please explicitly release/transfer the custody claim and identify the authorized successor.\\n\\nDo not post task contents, hidden answers, private validators, author logs, or private digests here. No qualification run will start before fresh custody acceptance and evaluator preflight pass.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T23:41:04Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Custody coordination update (public metadata only; no task payloads, answers, private validators, or author logs accessed): the SUITE claim was released at 2026-10-30 04:23 UTC after isolated synthetic evaluator tests completed. The custody record's T2 revalidation dependency on SUITE is now clear. Please resume custodian-only compatibility revalidation and provide a status-only update on remaining custody checks and whether the successor corpus can reach acceptance. If the current custodian cannot continue, please explicitly release or transfer the protected claim at a safe boundary. No protected content is requested here.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-30T04:28:47Z\"}],\"number\":1,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"PLAN-10 task 8: finish and seal the held-out T2/T3 corpus\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-30T04:28:47Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1\"}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":670780862}},"started_at_ms":1793344957244,"completed_at_ms":1793344957915}}
