{"timestamp":"2026-10-30T07:23:48.912Z","ordinal":522133,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a18bb1-832f-7f90-a054-d5bd1fb8440c","call_id":"call_0655bd828f4a40199d18fb13b560d38f","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 1.6 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"i\":0,\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":{\"chunk_id\":\"f20dd9\",\"wall_time_seconds\":1.067106145,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":4861,\"output\":\"Warning: truncated output (original token count: 4861)\\nTotal output lines: 1\\n\\n{\\\"baseRefOid\\\":\\\"5c516476e8dfcaf9cdd59eaa204134e25d2be673\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"## Summary\\\\n\\\\nArchives installed `v1.0.0-rc.11` scripted PTY evidence against the exact candidate artifact:\\\\n\\\\n- Source: `8d4e5319f1a31ee67e31d3edb6b44c2e7d9ecb05`\\\\n- Linux archive SHA-256: `72d73f3565a48fb83d0c9a13a93fe38c2a3ae8af75184dab3af73c0b749c4053`\\\\n\\\\nThe packet preserves raw PTY captures and scripts, corrected s1 follow-up evidence, three s9 named-survivor runs, and a timestamped three-trial s5 cancellation rerun. The s5 rerun observed the first `cancelling…` output 2.266–3.366ms after Ctrl-C and idle within 188.367–521.106ms. That is within the recorded 16.667ms one-frame budget and 5s idle bound for the synthetic PTY scenario.\\\\n\\\\n## Independent review and limits\\\\n\\\\n`plan05_readonly_review` independently ACCEPTed the earlier corrected packet’s accuracy and integrity, including s9, while §5.2 was pending due to missing s5 timing. The new s5 timestamped evidence was added afterward and is awaiting fresh independent review. This PR does not claim exact-RC or whole-release acceptance. No held-out material or user workspace was accessed.\\\\n\\\\n## Validation\\\\n\\\\n- Outer and nested SHA-256 inventories verified.\\\\n- `gitleaks dir` found no leaks.\\\\n- No embedded `.git` stores or Python bytecode are included.\\\\n- The exact installed RC11 binary reported `1.0.0-rc.11 (8d4e5319f1a3)` and its archive digest matched the recorded release digest.\\\\n- The initial runner setup lacked `pyte` and stopped before any trial. The pinned dependency was installed in a disposable virtual environment; all three recorded trials then completed.\\\\n\\\",\\\"commits\\\":[{\\\"authoredDate\\\":\\\"2026-10-30T02:45:09Z\\\",\\\"authors\\\":[{\\\"email\\\":\\\"mike@holownych.com\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\\\",\\\"login\\\":\\\"mikeholownych\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Mike Holownych\\\"}],\\\"committedDate\\\":\\\"2026-10-30T02:45:09Z\\\",\\\"messageBody\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"messageHeadline\\\":\\\"docs(qualification): archive RC11 scripted PTY evidence\\\",\\\"oid\\\":\\\"87a332f4036bb7af81ccf1e751189c19dd523149\\\"},{\\\"authoredDate\\\":\\\"2026-10-30T02:50:35Z\\\",\\\"authors\\\":[{\\\"email\\\":\\\"mike@holownych.com\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\\\",\\\"login\\\":\\\"mikeholownych\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Mike Holownych\\\"}],\\\"committedDate\\\":\\\"2026-10-30T02:50:35Z\\\",\\\"messageBody\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"messageHeadline\\\":\\\"docs(qualification): measure RC11 PTY cancel acknowledgment\\\",\\\"oid\\\":\\\"8ae6ec4d6e1efd2e1f1625d8488aed25b8c012fd\\\"},{\\\"authoredDate\\\":\\\"2026-10-30T02:55:15Z\\\",\\\"authors\\\":[{\\\"email\\\":\\\"mike@holownych.com\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\\\",\\\"login\\\":\\\"mikeholownych\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Mike Holownych\\\"}],\\\"committedDate\\\":\\\"2026-10-30T02:55:15Z\\\",\\\"messageBody\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"messageHeadline\\\":\\\"docs(qualification): correct RC11 PTY evidence file list\\\",\\\"oid\\\":\\\"165a2734548737de3ea426887dcb25980e6f0a8a\\\"}],\\\"files\\\":[{\\\"path\\\":\\\"docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.11/scripted-pty/RC11-SCRIPTED-RESULTS.md\\\",\\\"additions\\\":31,\\\"deletions\\\":0,\\\"changeType\\\":\\\"ADDED\\\"},{\\\"path\\\":\\\"docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.11/scripted-pty/README.md\\\",\\\"additions\\\":21,\\\"deletions\\\":0,\\\