{"timestamp":"2026-10-30T07:27:01.474Z","ordinal":522326,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18b8d-60e7-7130-962f-f0eb9e68c409","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-44537c2e-9046-4bf3-ab03-9cc537b8c574","process_id":"10546","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh pr view 342 --json headRefOid,updatedAt,comments --jq '{headRefOid,updatedAt,comments:(.comments|map({author:.author.login,createdAt,body})|.[-3:])}'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh pr view 342 --json headRefOid,updatedAt,comments --jq '{headRefOid,updatedAt,comments:(.comments|map({author:.author.login,createdAt,body})|.[-3:])}'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\"comments\":[{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Independent read-only review at exact head `26c1f541beb3d868e0c3e1604abf674e7aa05949` (base `d68695f3cb299c51959169d2373f7b924496486e`), diff SHA-256 `cf75b63f9d3b90491e5bb1f03f4486fcf2dbf1e9654be17079d21bf2b17781d0`:\\n\\n**CONCERNS (one non-blocking test gap).** The three workflow CLI suite steps use the intended 45-minute timeout, and the RC14 notes accurately describe the timeout and unresolved hang cause. The parity assertion currently accepts any numeric timeout, so it would also pass if one workflow drifted from the intended 45 minutes. Please assert `timeout-minutes: 45` for each workflow job. No source or tests were run by the reviewer; this review does not qualify the RC.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-30T07:23:05Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Metadata-only audit found a factual correction needed in the RC14 release notes: tag run 41009328850 for RC13 is verified as CANCELLED while CLI tests were active, with downstream packaging skipped. The available logs do not show a test failure or the stated compiler-exposure refusal. Please describe the run as cancelled unless you have a separate exact failure record to cite. This preserves the verified outcome without attributing an unsupported cause.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-30T07:23:11Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Correction to the metadata-only audit comment above: I verified release run 41009328850 with `--attempt 1` explicitly. Its `package` job log shows test 308 and test 351 each failing with `compiler exposure could not be checked; refusing qualification` at 05:43:15Z and 05:44:42Z; that attempt’s CLI test step was later cancelled at 06:21:18Z. Attempt 2 also ended cancelled in the CLI test step. The RC14 note about those attempt-1 test failures is supported by the archived run log; the earlier claim that the available logs showed no such failure was incorrect. No RC13 artifact was produced.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-30T07:25:03Z\"}],\"headRefOid\":\"26c1f541beb3d868e0c3e1604abf674e7aa05949\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-30T07:25:03Z\"}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":440698223}},"started_at_ms":1793345221033,"completed_at_ms":1793345221474}}
