y\\\":\\\"Correction to the metadata-only audit comment above: I verified release run 41009328850 with `--attempt 1` explicitly. Its `package` job log shows test 308 and test 351 each failing with `compiler exposure could not be checked; refusing qualification` at 05:43:15Z and 05:44:42Z; that attempt’s CLI test step was later cancelled at 06:21:18Z. Attempt 2 also ended cancelled in the CLI test step. The RC14 note about those attempt-1 test failures is supported by the archived run log; the earlier claim that the available logs showed no such failure was incorrect. No RC13 artifact was produced.\\\",\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-30T07:25:03Z\\\"}],\\\"headRefOid\\\":\\\"26c1f541beb3d868e0c3e1604abf674e7aa05949\\\"}\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18b8d-60e7-7130-962f-f0eb9e68c409","create_time":1793345272.4672}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
