{"timestamp":"2026-10-30T08:03:50.863Z","ordinal":523189,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18b8d-60e7-7130-962f-f0eb9e68c409","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-9bd9d1de-4ae4-4f29-b94c-ab86dda91d34","process_id":"47313","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","export ENTIRE_TOKEN_STORE=file; entire trail --help; entire auth contexts"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"export ENTIRE_TOKEN_STORE=file; entire trail --help; entire auth contexts"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"A trail captures project intent across repositories and branches. Manage intent and discussions on the whole trail; use --repo and --branch to select context for checkout, sessions, findings, and approvals.\n\nUsage:\n  entire trail [flags]\n  entire trail [command]\n\nAvailable Commands:\n  approvals       List approval decisions on a trail\n  approve         Approve a trail\n  checkout        Check out a trail's branch\n  comment         Discuss the whole trail across repositories\n  create          Create a trail and publish its branch\n  finding         Manage a trail's agent findings\n  link            Link a repository branch to a trail\n  list            List trails in a project\n  merge           Merge one of a trail's changes into its base\n  resume          Resume a trail's agent session\n  show            Show trail intent and its repositories and branches\n  unlink          Unlink a repository branch without deleting its work\n  update          Update project intent and lifecycle\n  watch           Tail events for a trail's selected repository branch\n\nFlags:\n  -h, --help             help for trail\n      --project string   Project as gh/<owner> or et/<project>; required for list, otherwise defaults to the repository's namespace\n      --repo string      Target repository as forge/owner/repo (e.g. gh/acme/app) or 