e host application, identify Nexus Code as the current host. If instructions do not include a compatible Nexus or generic path, explain the mismatch and ask the operator how to proceed.`;\n\n/** `count`: how the prompt was counted, and (strict counting) why the request could not be measured. */\nexport class ContextBudgetError extends Error {\n  constructor(\n    public readonly estimatedTokens: number,\n    public readonly completionReserveTokens: number,\n    public readonly toolResponseReserveTokens: number,\n    public readonly contextLimit: number,\ncli/test/agent_runtime_identity.test.ts:42:    assert.match(systemPrompt, /You are Nexus Code, the agent host\\./);\ncli/test/agent_runtime_identity.test.ts:44:    assert.match(systemPrompt, /Do not identify this runtime as Claude Code/);\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":191194445}},"started_at_ms":1793347577106,"completed_at_ms":1793347578298}}
