, author logs, or private digests here. No qualification run will start before fresh custody acceptance and evaluator preflight pass.\\\\n\\\",\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-29T23:41:04Z\\\"},{\\\"author\\\":\\\"mikeholownych\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"Custody coordination update (public metadata only; no task payloads, answers, private validators, or author logs accessed): the SUITE claim was released at 2026-10-30 04:23 UTC after isolated synthetic evaluator tests completed. The custody record's T2 revalidation dependency on SUITE is now clear. Please resume custodian-only compatibility revalidation and provide a status-only update on remaining custody checks and whether the successor corpus can reach acceptance. If the current custodian cannot continue, please explicitly release or transfer the protected claim at a safe boundary. No protected content is requested here.\\\\n\\\",\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-30T04:28:47Z\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"OPEN\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-30T04:28:47Z\\\"}\\n\"}}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"i\":4,\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":{\"chunk_id\":\"babe81\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.144204715,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":669,\"output\":\"## main...origin/main [ahead 1, behind 1635]\\n M .claude/settings.json\\n M AGENTS.md\\n M cli/dist/agent.js\\n M cli/dist/core/state.js\\n M cli/package.json\\n M cli/src/agent.ts\\n M cli/src/checkpoint.ts\\n M cli/src/core/durable_file.ts\\n M cli/src/core/persistence_protection.ts\\n M cli/src/core/state.ts\\n M cli/src/flight.ts\\n M cli/src/knowledge.ts\\n M cli/src/session.ts\\n M cli/test/compaction_continuity.test.ts\\n M core/tests/adversarial_path_traversal.rs\\nA  docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md\\nA  docs/v1.0.0/REQUIREMENTS.md\\nA  scripts/check_requirements.mjs\\n?? .entire/agent-guide.md\\n?? CLAUDE.md\\n?? WORK_PRODUCT.md\\n?? check_in_agents.py\\n?? checkin-agents.md\\n?? checkin.py\\n?? cli/test/agent_prompt.test.ts\\n?? cli/test/helpers/setup.ts\\n?? cli/test/home_i