{"timestamp":"2026-10-30T08:09:18.913Z","ordinal":523420,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18bda-0a8d-7963-bd38-a3a61a293f7d","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-5fb7ff62-2a0d-4fcf-a5de-b5953079945b","process_id":"8340","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","git ls-remote --tags origin 'refs/tags/v1.0.0-rc.14' 'refs/tags/v1.0.0-rc.14^{}'; gh release view v1.0.0-rc.14 --json tagName,isDraft,isPrerelease,assets,url 2>&1; gh pr view 342 --json number,state,headRefOid,baseRefName,mergeStateStatus,reviewDecision,updatedAt,statusCheckRollup,url,comments --jq '{number,state,headRefOid,baseRefName,mergeStateStatus,reviewDecision,updatedAt,url,checks:[.statusCheckRollup[]?|{name:.name,status:.status,conclusion:.conclusion,detailsUrl:.detailsUrl}],comments:[.comments[-5:][]?|{author:.author.login,createdAt:.createdAt,body:.body}]}'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"git ls-remote --tags origin 'refs/tags/v1.0.0-rc.14' 'refs/tags/v1.0.0-rc.14^{}'; gh release view v1.0.0-rc.14 --json tagName,isDraft,isPrerelease,assets,url 2>&1; gh pr view 342 --json number,state,headRefOid,baseRefName,mergeStateStatus,reviewDecision,updatedAt,statusCheckRollup,url,comments --jq '{number,state,headRefOid,baseRefName,mergeStateStatus,reviewDecision,updatedAt,url,checks:[.statusCheckRollup[]?|{name:.name,status:.status,conclusion:.conclusion,detailsUrl:.detailsUrl}],comments:[.comments[-5:][]?|{author:.author.login,createdAt:.createdAt,body:.body}]}'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"release not found\n{\"baseRefName\":\"main\",\"checks\":[{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/41019505916/job/123943361949\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (22)\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/41019505875/job/123943361937\",\"name\":\"javascript-typescript\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/41019505916/job/123943362235\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (24)\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/41019505916/job/123950053717\",\"name\":\"linux-x86_64\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":\"\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://entire.com/gh/mikeholownych/-/trails/58/changes/nexus-code/57\",\"name\":\"Entire Gates\",\"status\":\"IN_PROGRESS\"},{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/runs/123943710982\",\"name\":\"CodeQL\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":null,\"detailsUrl\":null,\"name\":null,\"status\":null}],\"comments\":[{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Independent delta review (same fresh-context read-only reviewer) of f05b3d40..5e400d5c5af8e8c0e1a07bac59e54d921babe168: **ACCEPT**, 0 blocking. The delta is two lines in docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.14.md, and both wordings match eval/isolate.mjs. The reviewer's caveat that a main CI run stalled is verified by run 40999028554: test-matrix (22) ran 03:44:14Z to 04:57:05Z and was cancelled; its last completed test was the final test in eval_integrity.test.ts.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-30T07:15:55Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Rebased onto main d68695f3 (the #335 merge, whose tree is identical to d01b25cc). The new head is 26c1f541beb3d868e0c3e1604abf674e7aa05949. `git diff origin/main 26c1f541beb3d868e0c3e1604abf674e7aa05949` is byte-identical to the reviewed `git diff d01b25cc 5e400d5c`, so the independent ACCEPTs carry over unchanged. requirements --enforce: exit 0; sync-version: rc.14. Marked ready; merge waits for exact-head green CI.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-30T07:20:38Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Independent read-only review at exact head `26c1f541beb3d868e0c3e1604abf674e7aa05949` (base `d68695f3cb299c51959169d2373f7b924496486e`), diff SHA-256 `cf75b63f9d3b90491e5bb1f03f4486fcf2dbf1e9654be17079d21bf2b17781d0`:\\n\\n**CONCERNS (one non-blocking test gap).** The three workflow CLI suite steps use the intended 45-minute timeout, and the RC14 notes accurately describe the timeout and unresolved hang cause. The parity assertion currently accepts any numeric timeout, so it would also pass if one workflow drifted from the intended 45 minutes. Please assert `timeout-minutes: 45` for each workflow job. No source or tests were run by the reviewer; this review does not qualify the RC.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-30T07:23:05Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Metadata-only audit found a factual correction needed in the RC14 release notes: tag run 41009328850 for RC13 is verified as CANCELLED while CLI tests were active, with downstream packaging skipped. The available logs do not show a test failure or the stated compiler-exposure refusal. Please describe the run as cancelled unless you have a separate exact failure record to cite. This preserves the verified outcome without attributing an unsupported cause.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-30T07:23:11Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Correction to the metadata-only audit comment above: I verified release run 41009328850 with `--attempt 1` explicitly. Its `package` job log shows test 308 and test 351 each failing with `compiler exposure could not be checked; refusing qualification` at 05:43:15Z and 05:44:42Z; that attempt’s CLI test step was later cancelled at 06:21:18Z. Attempt 2 also ended cancelled in the CLI test step. The RC14 note about those attempt-1 test failures is supported by the archived run log; the earlier claim that the available logs showed no such failure was incorrect. No RC13 artifact was produced.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-30T07:25:03Z\"}],\"headRefOid\":\"26c1f541beb3d868e0c3e1604abf674e7aa05949\",\"mergeStateStatus\":\"UNSTABLE\",\"number\":342,\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-30T07:25:03Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/342\"}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":449649900}},"started_at_ms":1793347757463,"completed_at_ms":1793347758913}}
