{"timestamp":"2026-10-30T08:12:52.812Z","ordinal":523571,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a18bde-6ecc-7301-bddf-6ecbfe1d1bc5","author":"/root/review_pr302","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/review_pr302\nPayload:\n**CHANGES_REQUIRED** — reviewed base `d68695f3cb299c51959169d2373f7b924496486e` to head `26c1f541beb3d868e0c3e1604abf674e7aa05949`. Cumulative diff SHA-256: `cf75b63f9d3b90491e5bb1f03f4486fcf2dbf1e9654be17079d21bf2b17781d0`.\n\n- **P2 — Timeout parity regression is too weak.** [`release_workflow_parity.test.ts:50`](/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc14-source-gates-20261030T0723Z/cli/test/release_workflow_parity.test.ts:50) checks that each CLI test step has *some numeric timeout*. It would pass if CI used 2 minutes while release used 45, so it does not protect the workflow parity this test covers. Assert the expected `45` for each job, or assert all three parsed values match.\n- **P2 — RC13 notes are changed after its tag.** The candidate adds a “Not published” status to [`v1.0.0-rc.13.md:5`](/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc14-source-gates-20261030T0723Z/docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.13.md:5), but the RC13 tag’s copy does not contain it. The RC14 notes already record RC13’s failed workflow and unpublished status at [`v1.0.0-rc.14.md:7`](/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc14-source-gates-20261030T0723Z/docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.14.md:7). Keep the correction in RC14/current status documentation and leave the tagged RC13 notes unchanged to preserve the release-note freeze.\n\nThe 45-minute bound is applied consistently to the three workflow steps, and the RC14 notes state the non-exit cause is unknown and qualification remains outstanding. No tests were run. The candidate worktree lacks `.entire/agent-guide.md`; I used the available release-process guidance that tagged RC notes are frozen."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18bda-0a8d-7963-bd38-a3a61a293f7d","create_time":1793347972.8123355,"content_item_metadata":[{"provenance":{"type":"tool","namespace":"collaboration"}}]}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":24119}}
