ty concern and RC13 tag-note mutability were found in a fresh independent review and corrected in PR343\",\n  \"followup_pr343\": {\n    \"head\": \"5ed883af23a41743018caeb1bc7988d0c8d27aa0\",\n    \"base\": \"890c553d6f283176d9d95edaea489811584c8930\",\n    \"status\": \"OPEN; exact CI Node22/Node24/JS-TS queued\",\n    \"review\": \"ACCEPT read-only review, diff SHA-256 046ad5b708bc2fca2994f2a562cbd692e76302bc4c9264db69aaafc1d0f0e493\",\n    \"focused_test\": \"node --test cli/test/release_workflow_parity.test.ts PASS\",\n    \"scope\": \"assert 45-minute timeout and restore tagged RC13 notes\",\n    \"ci\": \"Node22 IN_PROGRESS; Node24 IN_PROGRESS; JavaScript/TypeScript SUCCESS; CodeQL SUCCESS; Entire Gates IN_PROGRESS\",\n    \"requirements\": \"PASS exact 5ed883af: 123 rows, 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open, 12 exact-RC deferrals\",\n    \"version\": \"PASS exact 5ed883af: all components 1.0.0-rc.14\",\n    \"checks\": \"Node22 suite active since 08:17:40Z; Node24 SUCCESS; JavaScript/TypeScript SUCCESS; CodeQL SUCCESS; Entire Gates IN_PROGRESS, trail59 open/no approvals.\",\n    \"entire\": \"trail59 open; no approvals; independent external Entire approval unavailable in current auth context\"\n  },\n  \"historical_evaluator_ci_audit\": {\n    \"pr_336\": \"Run 40991294490 Node24 failed: hardened selftest reports compiler exposure could not be checked; refusing qualification; exact failed base 5c516476 predates scanner fixes in 890c553d.\",\n    \"pr_338\": \"Run 40992017829 Linux failed 5 tests including compiler exposure refusal and x.mjs fixture errors; PR base 5c516476 predates current scanner fixes; rebase and exact-head checks required before evidence integration.\",\n    \"pr_339\": \"Run 40994457283 Node22 failed one pytest hidden-source test on same old base with compiler exposure refusal; rebase/revalidate.\",\n    \"pr_334\": \"Run 41009682069 Linux failed T4 overloaded smoke at cli/test/eval_harness.test.ts:112; assertion got undefined for model.faultsInjected. Exact test/proxy source is unchanged between failing base 1acff700 and current main 890c553d. Failure record lacks error detail because eval/run catch returns reduced record. Classification unresolved, possible intermittent/failure-path issue; targeted current-main reproduction needed after active SUITE run completes.\",\n    \"next\": \"After hosted SUITE 41024603827 terminates and SUITE claim releases, run only the synthetic overloaded T4 smoke on a clean current-main snapshot with richer failure diagnostics; preserve the failed historical run and do not treat the single green later suite as root-cause evidence.\"\n  },\n  \"diagnostic_work\": \"Isolated worktree has diagnostic assertions for T4 missing proxy telemetry and peer evaluation hiddenPass failure; diff-check passes; npm ci completed; no tests until all hosted suite jobs release SUITE.\"\n}\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18bed-1e39-7a80-8dda-b29fbcdc44b3","create_time":1793349205.5748055}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
