   ],\n      \"kind\": \"invariant\",\n      \"text\": \"A live SUITE claim excludes targeted tests and held-out author validation runs as well as full suites; other agents must defer test execution until the claim is released.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"history\": {\n    \"matches\": [\n      {\n        \"path\": \"sessions/unknown/REDACTED.jsonl\",\n        \"line\": 21060,\n        \"excerpt\": \"Bash {\\\"command\\\":\\\"rtk proxy grep -E '^2026-10-27T(0[7-9]|1[01])' .git/nexus-claims.log | rtk proxy grep -v claude-code | rtk proxy grep -v -E 'retain SUITE|progress|PROGRESS|REFRESH|CHECKIN|SUITE_?(CLAIM|RELEASE)' | cut -c1-260 | tail -10; echo ---; rtk proxy grep -i -E 'human|owner action|OWNER_ACTION|needs owner|custody|held-out|terminal matrix|ACC-PLAT|BLOCKED' .git/nexus-claims.log | tail -6 | cut -c1-260\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Find current blockers for rc.10 acceptance\\\"}\",\n        \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-28T00:51:03Z\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"sessions/unknown/REDACTED.jsonl\",\n        \"line\": 2195,\n        \"excerpt\": \"Skill {\\\"args\\\":\\\"Drive Nexus Code v1.0.0 to verified release as claude-code (independent review / suite-diagnosis lane, owner of PR #56). Each iteration: fetch origin; read new nexus-claims.log entries and PR/CI state for open v1 PRs; act on whatever is unblocked (review new heads independently, merge my own PRs only after independent ACCEPT + exact-head green CI, fix findings on my claimed slices, re-run requirements --enforce at new integration heads, diagnose CI failures); respect CONCURRENCY claims, SUITE serialization, held-out isolation, and never self-accept. Record actions in the shared log. Stop only at verified v1.0.0 publication, user cancellation, or a concrete external blocker....\",\n        \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-28T00:51:03Z\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"sessions/unknown/REDACTED.jsonl\",\n        \"line\": 5680,\n        \"excerpt\": \"Bash {\\\"command\\\":\\\"cd /home/mike/nexus-code; U=$(gh issue create --label v1.0.0 --title \\\\\\\"PLAN-10 PR-10m: accept hardened evaluator boundary (PR #33) and qualification host before held-out runs\\\\\\\" --body \\\\\\\"## Scope Track the current critical-path blocker for every held-out run (#1, #2). Until now it was tracked only in READINESS.md and the claim log. ## Current state (\\\\\\\\`v1/integration\\\\\\\\` @ \\\\\\\\`6a16cb6\\\\\\\\`, 2026-10-18) - PR #33 (owner: eval-impl) is open at \\\\\\\\`3db2cf4\\\\\\\\`. Independent reviewers returned CHANGES-REQUIRED: a Python leak via candidate import of \\\\\\\\`sitecustomize\\\\\\\\`; Go/Rust compile-time embedding; and host-source mounts in \\\\\\\\`agentSandboxArgv\\\\\\\\` that \\\\\\\\`runtimeCorpusOverlapProblem\\\\...\",\n        \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-19T10:43:31Z\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"likely_edit_files\": [\n    \"docs/cloudflare/AGENT_COLLABORATION_EXPERIMENT_2_EVIDENCE.json\",\n    \"docs/v1.0.0/plans/PLAN-07-supply-chain-and-release-engineering.md\",\n    \"docs/v1.0.0/specs/SPEC-07-supply-chain-and-release-engineering.md\",\n    \"docs/v1.0.0/evidence/D_pty/mockgw.py\",\n    \"docs/v1.0.0/evidence/D_pty/ptylib.py\",\n    \"docs/v1.0.0/evidence/D_pty/r1_repl.py\",\n    \"docs/v1.0.0/evidence/D_pty/r1d.py\",\n    \"docs/v1.0.0/evidence/D_pty/s1_startup.py\"\n  ],\n  \"likely_test_files\": [\n    \"docs/v1.0.0/evidence/repro/agt_repro.test.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"likely_files\": [\n    \"docs/cloudflare/AGENT_COLLABORATION_EXPERIMENT_2_EVIDENCE.json\",\n    \"docs/v1.0.0/plans/PLAN-07-supply-chain-and-release-engineering.md\",\n    \"docs/v1.0.0/specs/SPEC-07-supply-chain-and-release-engineering.md\",\n    \"docs/v1.0.0/evidence/D_pty/mockgw.py\",\n    \"docs/v1.0.0/evidence/D_pty/ptylib.py\",\n    \"docs/v1.0.0/evidence/D_pty/r1_repl.py\",\n    \"docs/v1.0.0/evidence/D_pty/r1d.py\",\n    \"docs/v1.0.0/evidence/D_pty/s1_startup.py\",\n    \"docs/v1.0.0/evidence/repro/agt_repro.test.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"guidance\": [\n    \"Treat the brain as an indexed snapshot, not live memory.\",\n    \"Use likely_edit_files and history matches before text search; if search is still needed, scope it to likely_files and specific identifiers. Use likely_test_files for validation context.\",\n    \"Use the live-state overlay before trusting code-context results for files changed in this session.\",\n    \"Inspect full diffs or source files when the task intersects dirty files or when confidence is low.\"\n  ],\n  \"semantic\": {\n    \"context\": {\n      \"symbols\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"gh/mikeholownych/nexus-code:Rust:core/src/bin/nexus_tui/live_view.rs:function:command_output_is_bounded_with_an_exact_count_and_failures_never_look_successful\",\n          \"kind\": \"function\",\n          \"name\": \"command_output_is_bounded_with_an_exact_count_and_failures_never_look_successful\",\n          \"qualified_name\": \"command_output_is_bounded_with_an_exact_count_and_failures_never_look_successful\",\n          \"file_path\": \"core/src/bin/nexus_tui/live_view.rs\",\n          \"start_line\": 3583,\n          \"end_line\": 3609,\n          \"signature\": \"fn command_output_is_bounded_with_an_exact_count_and_failures_never_look_successful()\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"gh/mikeholownych/nexus-code:JSON:docs/cloudflare/AGENT_COLLABORATION_EXPERIMENT_2_EVIDENCE.json:section:diagnostics\",\n          \"kind\": \"section\",\n          \"name\": \"diagnostics\",\n          \"qualified_name\": \"diagnostics\",\n          \"file_path\": \"docs/cloudflare/AGENT_COLLABORATION_EXPERIMENT_2_EVIDENCE.json\",\n          \"start_line\": 95,\n          \"end_line\": 95,\n          \"signature\": \"json key diagnostics\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"gh/mikeholownych/nexus-code:TypeScript:cli/src/core/state.ts:field:TaskRecoveryResult.diagnostics\",\n          \"kind\": \"field\",\n          \"name\": \"diagnostics\",\n          \"qualified_name\": \"TaskRecoveryResult.diagnostics\",\n         