{"timestamp":"2026-10-30T08:53:39.890Z","ordinal":525255,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18bff-7011-7da3-8833-52d22c944baa","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0db389702a7164cc016ae45b133854819f94fe6b00670b5bbc","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"I found why the peer case failed closed: this host’s group-writable checkout made the trusted scanner helper fail its file-permission check. CI’s clean checkout does not have that mode. I’ll correct only the isolated worktree’s file mode (without changing Git’s recorded mode), build the missing CLI artifact, and rerun the diagnostics."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793350419235,"completed_at_ms":1793350419890}}
