{"timestamp":"2026-10-30T08:59:27.973Z","ordinal":525591,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18bff-7011-7da3-8833-52d22c944baa","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0db389702a7164cc016ae45c6f54e0819f9e198b30280c605f","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The second failure is now explained precisely: CI builds `harness-core` in release mode before this suite. The local debug binary exists, but the evaluator’s sandbox only exposes the release binary as a selected runtime executable, so the agent cannot launch the debug binary. I’m matching CI’s release build now; this is a local setup mismatch, not evidence of a shipping defect."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793350767349,"completed_at_ms":1793350767973}}
