026-10-30T08:34:30Z RC11_PTY_PACKET_DELTA commit=586f5c9e independent_review=ACCEPT staged_diff_sha256=09b70d5699175a3730756f8cded271054e26cfd76030b341d65502bcba6983e1 top_and_nested_checksums=verified REDACTED; do_not_push/rebase until SUITE terminal. Historical RC11 only; no RC acceptance claim.\n2026-10-30T08:35:20Z RC11_PTY_PACKET_DELTA exact_commit=586f5c9edb8bfe88eb698867d42ea1fe620087a8 independent_review=ACCEPT staged_diff_sha256=09b70d5699175a3730756f8cded271054e26cfd76030b341d65502bcba6983e1 top_manifest=116_entries_verified nested_manifest=20_entries_verified diff_check=PASS REDACTED; wait for SUITE terminal before remote push.\n2026-10-30T08:40:10Z PR343_REVIEW exact_head=5ed883af23a41743018caeb1bc7988d0c8d27aa0 base=890c553d6f283176d9d95edaea489811584c8930 disposition=ACCEPT reviewer=current_main_rc_path_audit diff_sha256=046ad5b708bc2fca2994f2a562cbd692e76302bc4c9264db69aaafc1d0f0e493; verifies 45-minute workflow timeout parity and restores signed RC13 tag notes; no publication/acceptance implied. Await hosted CI.\n2026-10-30T08:40:50Z PR336_REVIEW head=8f742f11141b33969c941d5089b8a257f3819e2d base=5c516476e8dfcaf9cdd59eaa204134e25d2be673 diff_sha256=c261f8ecde213fc6563f2772ccfedde8c4f8ce20c82fcfa14c7ecad805984ee3 independent_review=ACCEPT historical_RC11_crossrunner_packet_only; packet_checksums_verified; REQ-REL-114 tested_at_RC11 does_not_satisfy_current_exact_RC gate; READINESS checkpoint stale and current checks fail Node24/Linux skipped/Entire failure; do_not_merge_as_is. Reviewer recommends refresh readiness at exact main and rerun checks.\n2026-10-30T08:41:35Z RELEASE_CHECKPOINT exact_main=890c553d6f283176d9d95edaea489811584c8930 run41024603827 Node22+Node24=SUCCESS Linux_x86_64=IN_PROGRESS_in_CLI_suite; earlier setup/build/cargo checks passed; security/repro/package/smoke pending; CodeQL41024603876=SUCCESS. PR343 exact_head=5ed883af23a41743018caeb1bc7988d0c8d27aa0 Node22+Node24+JS_TS+CodeQL=SUCCESS Linux_x86_64=IN_PROGRESS_in_CLI_suite Entire59=IN_PROGRESS_no_approval. Held-out issue1 status unchanged since 04:28 UTC, protected custodian claim retained.\n2026-10-30T08:50:00Z HISTORICAL_UPGRADE_REDIRECT_RECONCILIATION: user-reported RC7 rejection of release-assets.githubusercontent.com predates fix 64c22d3e6fc20c36432946abc8e237017d4b91be (2026-10-26). Exact current source allowlists only HTTPS /github-production-release-asset/ on that host and has regression coverage for signed redirects, redirect limits, and no credential forwarding; signed tag v1.0.0-rc.8 resolves to f847ca34 and contains the fix; public RC8 archive exists. Disposition: source fix is in published RC8+, but no fresh installed upgrade from RC7 to current candidate is evidenced here; preserve exact-RC upgrade/install validation as pending.\n2026-10-30T08:52:30Z RELEASE_SUITE hosted CLI suite steps on main CI41024603827 and PR343 CI41025109758 completed; both Linux jobs advanced to package/repro steps. Released SUITE for focused diagnostics. CLAIM_GATEWAY codex-root synthetic mock-gateway diagnostics in isolated worktree /home/mike/nexus-wt/eval-t4-overload-diagnostic; no live provider or held-out corpus.\n2026-10-30T08:55:00Z POSTMERGE_CI_TERMINAL main=890c553d run41024603827=SUCCESS Node22/Node24/Linux_package+repro+smoke+installer; CodeQL41024603876=SUCCESS. RC14 tag/artifact absent; latest public RC11; stable absent. Next: follow versioned release plan/owner tag boundary; then mandatory exact-RC qualification.\n2026-10-30T08:56:53Z SUITE_CLAIM agent=codex-root base=16eeb6eeffe7fc0bae234aa34dcb671a6ba5ff99 run=41029564419 scope=monitor_hosted_node22_node24_full_suites_only\n2026-10-30T08:57:05Z GATEWAY_RELEASE agent=codex-root claim=GATEWAY branch=v1/eval-t4-overload-diagnostic result=focused_mock_diagnostic_not_validated due evaluator_preflight_missing CI-pinned Go/Rust roots; no live inference; no protected tasks\n2026-10-30T08:57:16Z PR343_MERGED exact_head=5ed883af23a41743018caeb1bc7988d0c8d27aa0 merge=16eeb6eeffe7fc0bae234aa34dcb67