ly\",\n  \"previous_agent\": \"kimi-code\",\n  \"status\": \"TAKEN OVER FOR PUBLIC-ONLY COORDINATION; protected OpenCode custody claim remains intact. Same-host boot matches historical report but recorded PID 3848937 is absent; no handoff inferred. Metadata-only contact request to WhiteReef is pending approval. No private access or qualification.\",\n  \"reconciled_by\": \"codex-root\",\n  \"reconciled_at\": \"2026-10-29T21:32:36Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-29T22:58:00Z\"\n}\n\n[V1_RC11_EVIDENCE_CONSOLIDATION]\n{\n  \"agent\": \"codex-root\",\n  \"host\": \"mike-dev\",\n  \"branch\": \"v1/rc11-evidence-consolidation\",\n  \"base\": \"16eeb6eeffe7fc0bae234aa34dcb671a6ba5ff99\",\n  \"since\": \"2026-10-30T09:00:33Z\",\n  \"scope\": \"Integrate already independently reviewed historical RC11 provider/E2/scripted-PTY evidence packets from PR337, PR338, PR339 as disjoint documentation paths; preserve histories and RC11-only status; one hosted check cycle; no private/held-out material.\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc11-evidence-consolidation\",\n  \"head\": \"d0b95462f160c3255aef1c4b12834be770cbbfc4\",\n  \"diff_sha256\": \"0268fdfedaca630c24b2d22c987b5e1e48ca899f96293e04a70982a7b74cca65\",\n  \"status\": \"Prepared three evidence-only merges from previously reviewed PR337/338/339 sources; all provider, platform-E2, scripted-PTY and nested PTY checksum manifests verified; paths confined to those three evidence directories. Independent combined-diff review requested. git diff --check reports expected trailing whitespace in captured raw PTY transcripts; raw artifacts remain byte-identical to their checksum-verified manifests. Waiting for main CI/SUITE before any push or PR checks.\"\n}\n\n[V1_RC11_E5_PROVIDER_EVIDENCE]\n{\n  \"agent\": \"codex-root\",\n  \"host\": \"mike-dev\",\n  \"branch\": \"v1/rc11-e5-provider-evidence\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc11-provider-evidence\",\n  \"base\": \"5c516476e8dfcaf9cdd59eaa204134e25d2be673\",\n  \"since\": \"2026-10-30T00:54:29Z\",\n  \"scope\": \"Archive exact RC11 installed-artifact provider verification receipts and both provider outcomes; no source changes, no secret or prompt data; no claim of full E5 acceptance.\",\n  \"head\": \"ba72d2cbfb8f446254cf829ac5990148fed82500\",\n  \"status\": \"Independent review ACCEPT on exact PR head ba72d2cb; 22 manifest hashes verified; artifacts bind to RC11 tag/archive; provider failures/retries preserved; no raw prompts or credentials. Current main 38a875cc is two commits beyond base; rebase and refresh exact-head checks queued until PR335 full suite releases SUITE. No qualification/overall E5 acceptance claimed.\",\n  \"review\": {\n    \"reviewer\": \"review_pr300_readiness\",\n    \"disposition\": \"ACCEPT\",\n    \"diff_sha256\": \"bab1c8e8c846201646e048e969ff42423b2e6740e2cd53ff26f6df78bd9f0037\",\n    \"scope\": \"exact PR head and merge base; RC11 historical evidence only\"\n  },\n  \"last_updated\": \"2026-10-30T05:02:57Z\"\n}\n\n[V1_RC11_CROSS_RUNNER_EVIDENCE]\nabsent\n\n[V1_RC11_E2_PLATFORM_MATRIX]\n{\n  \"agent\": \"codex-root\",\n  \"host\": \"mike-dev\",\n  \"branch\": \"v1/rc11-e2-platform-evidence\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc11-e2-platform\",\n  \"base\": \"5c516476e8dfcaf9cdd59eaa204134e25d2be673\",\n  \"since\": \"2026-10-30T01:00:00Z\",\n  \"scope\": \"RC11 installed artifact E2 platform/Node preflight matrix on existing pinned Docker images; evidence only, no product changes.\",\n  \"head\": \"9b9fbef49af7eb3ef12c95178a3e6d76c5cc1574\",\n  \"status\": \"RC11 E2 evidence and provenance delta committed/rebased/pushed; checksums PASS; independent read-only review of complete current-base packet requested. Evidence remains E2 partial, not full ACC-PLAT.\"\n}\n\n[V1_RC11_SCRIPTED_PTY_EVIDENCE]\n{\n  \"agent\": \"codex-root\",\n  \"host\": \"mike-dev\",\n  \"branch\": \"v1/rc11-scripted-pty-evidence\",\n  \"base\": \"890c553d6f283176d9d95edaea489811584c8930\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/ne