d publication:** RC10 remains a prerelease; no stable `v1.0.0` release is claimed. Exact cross-runner reproducibility passed for immutable RC10 source `16ee8ca`; a successor candidate from current main still requires its own reproducibility run. Held-out custodian acceptance, T2/T3/T4, remaining live provider and standalone qualification, independent exact-RC acceptance, and human terminal evidence remain open. The five-environment by three-size operator terminal matrix remains **0/15**; no cell result or screenshot is recorded. Automated PTY evidence does not substitute for these human cells. Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; stable publication remains gated on all mandatory acceptance criteria.\n\nThe 17:31 and earlier checkpoints below are retained as historical evidence and superseded for current source, PR, CI, and requirements status by this checkpoint.\n\n## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-27 17:31 UTC)\n\n**Authoritative source and post-merge checks:** `origin/main` is `ceabfccf466ab39fc80c274400bae5aa0744a227`, integrating PR #275 after PR #273. Exact-main CI [40537474824](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40537474824) passed the Node 22, Node 24, and `linux-x86_64` jobs on `ceabfcc`; CodeQL [40537475057](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40537475057) also passed on that SHA. Earlier post-merge CI [40536704465](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40536704465) and CodeQL [40536704530](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40536704530) passed on `e94208d`. These establish source CI for those exact commits; they do not establish RC acceptance or release qualification.\n\n**Readiness PR #268:** GitHub reports PR [#268](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/268) open at exact remote head `d37746f20da27a8b11a9c25c14c08fe0db197add`, based on current `main` `ceabfccf466ab39fc80c274400bae5aa0744a227`. All exact-head checks passed: Node 22, Node 24, and `linu