{"timestamp":"2026-10-30T09:25:30.734Z","ordinal":526418,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a18c20-edee-7193-b436-29d8afe85d6c","call_id":"call_16008ac23e494e7ab5fc0ed7f2a38d1f","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/pr311_draft_review\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"**ACCEPT.** Prior acceptance still applies after rebase.\\n\\nCandidate HEAD is `c6f00e8f27c0af1a80e7131f8a6f52efa4aa0321`; base is `16eeb6eeffe7fc0bae234aa34dcb671a6ba5ff99`. Diff SHA-256: `d4b51c5450d98343c3cd7e6cd7fe216363541b11f3df97c5bfaa847d88b7d2a3`. The diff changes only `cli/test/eval_harness.test.ts`. Assertions retain the same acceptance semantics, and the added diagnostics remain limited to synthetic fixture data. No changed concern; review only, no tests run.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/review_pr300_readiness\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/review_pr302\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"**CHANGES_REQUIRED** — reviewed base `d68695f3cb299c51959169d2373f7b924496486e` to head `26c1f541beb3d868e0c3e1604abf674e7aa05949`. Cumulative diff SHA-256: `cf75b63f9d3b90491e5bb1f03f4486fcf2dbf1e9654be17079d21bf2b17781d0`.\\n\\n- **P2 — Timeout parity regression is too weak.** [`release_workflow_parity.test.ts:50`](/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc14-source-gates-20261030T0723Z/cli/test/release_workflow_parity.test.ts:50) checks that each CLI test step has *some numeric timeout*. It would pass if CI used 2 minutes while release used 45, so it does not protect the workflow parity this test covers. Assert the expected `45` for each job, or assert all three parsed values match.\\n- **P2 — RC13 notes are changed after its tag.** The candidate adds a “Not published” status to [`v1.0.0-rc.13.md:5`](/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc14-source-gates-20261030T0723Z/docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.13.md:5), but the RC13 tag’s copy does not contain it. The RC14 notes already record RC13’s failed workflow and unpublished status at [`v1.0.0-rc.14.md:7`](/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc14-source-gates-20261030T0723Z/docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.14.md:7). Keep the correction in RC14/current status documentation and leave the tagged RC13 notes unchanged to preserve the release-note freeze.\\n\\nThe 45-minute bound is applied consistently to the three workflow steps, and the RC14 notes state the non-exit cause is unknown and qualification remains outstanding. No tests were run. The candidate worktree lacks `.entire/agent-guide.md`; I used the available release-process guidance that tagged RC notes are frozen.\"}}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18c20-aec5-7552-93bd-755d714c245e","create_time":1793352330.7341087}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
