me":"mcp-search","tool_name":"get_observations"},{"first_turn_id":"01a1819d-146d-73e2-bca2-ef6bf60c3b33","server_name":"xerj","tool_name":"xerj_search"},{"first_turn_id":"01a1819d-146d-73e2-bca2-ef6bf60c3b33","server_name":"xerj","tool_name":"xerj_field_report"},{"first_turn_id":"01a18508-75af-7cb3-abdc-d10cbdc7b2fb","server_name":"mcp-agent-mail","tool_name":"summarize_recent"}],"status":"complete"}}],"resume_metadata":{"last_started_turn_id":"01a18c20-aec5-7552-93bd-755d714c245e","multi_agent_version":"v2","previous_turn_settings":{"comp_hash":"3000","model":"gpt-6-luna","realtime_active":false},"turn_attribution":{"initiating_agent_path":null,"parent_turn_id":null,"root_turn_id":"01a18c20-aec5-7552-93bd-755d714c245e","turn_id":"01a18c20-aec5-7552-93bd-755d714c245e","turn_trigger":"goal"}},"retained_context":{"assistant_messages":[{"complete":true,"message_id":"msg_0db389702a7164cc016ae46393ce04819f831871649b3bf2d2","order":24232,"phase":"commentary","revision":"retained_01a18c24-fd3f-7c03-9192-05faec9cbd47","text":"The public custody issue was updated moments ago: it identifies a compatibility blocker between the 40-task manifest’s historical validator form and the current isolated `blackbox-v1` runner, and explicitly says not to start held-out evaluation until the custodian validates a compatible corpus. I’m sending the custodian a matching status-only handoff request through the project’s agent mail; it contains no task content or private digests.","turn_id":"01a18c20-aec5-7552-93bd-755d714c245e"},{"complete":true,"message_id":"msg_0db389702a7164cc016ae463e71870819fb3b197c4a8a4b5c7","order":24234,"phase":"commentary","revision":"retained_01a18c26-445c-7510-b165-dd3cd6932d9d","text":"The clean detached worktree at exact `16eeb6ee` now passes `check_requirements.mjs --enforce` and RC14 version sync, with the 12 lifecycle-mapped requirements still explicitly deferred. I also confirmed the 40-task held-out path is not qualification-ready: its current validator contract requires `blackbox-v1`; the custodian status request is pending Agent Mail contact approval, and no held-out content was accessed.","turn_id":"01a18c20-aec5-7552-93bd-755d714c245e"},{"complete":true,"message_id":"msg_0db389702a7164cc016ae464b385a8819fa15a5361c9aece3c","order":24238,"phase":"commentary","revision":"retained_01a18c29-60e9-7dc3-a751-4ea3fd0adb68","text":"The source-stage gates are now verified on a clean Git worktree at the exact main commit. The only remaining pre-RC gate is the Linux CI job: its CLI suite is still running, with the 45-minute bound in place. The tag/release workflow and held-out/custody blockers are documented; I’m keeping the release candidate untagged until CI terminates.","turn_id":"01a18c20-aec5-7552-93bd-755d714c245e"},{"complete":true,"message_id":"msg_0db389702a7164cc016ae46504b244819f9c6529a4b9e9f208","order":24240,"phase":"commentary","revision":"retained_01a18c2a-9d6b-7600-a7e1-4d4753282af2","text":"The main Linux job has cleared its test suite: the release-core build, full CLI suite, security gates, requirements checker, and RC14 version check all passed on `16eeb6ee`. Linux packaging is now running. I’m waiting for the remaining package reproducibility, SBOM, smoke, and installer steps before treating source CI as complete or tagging RC14.","turn_id":"01a18c20-aec5-7552-93bd-755d714c245e"},{"complete":true,"message_id":"msg_0db389702a7164cc016ae4661a8f10819fbd3e31630260e6e8","order":24245,"phase":"commentary","revision":"retained_01a18c2e-dd8a-76a0-9d4b-d2573d2e3329","text":"Main CI `41029564419` is now **SUCCESS** on `16eeb6ee`: Node 22/24, Linux CLI/security, requirements report, reproducible packaging, SBOM validation, package smoke, and installer smoke all passed. The clean exact-commit `--enforce` and RC14 version checks also pass. I’m confirming suite-claim release and then will tag RC14 on this exact commit through the authorized signed-tag workflow, which creates the qualification artifact.","turn_id":"01a18c20-aec5-7552-93bd-755d714c245e"},{"complete":true,"message_id":"msg_0db389702a7164cc016ae466217a10819f9937a4050b4fc89d","order":24246,"phase":"commentary","revision":"retained_01a18c2e-f764-7000-9606-8d872a739e7a","text":"The suite claim is already gone, and the remote `v1.0.0-rc.14` tag now exists at the exact CI-passed commit `16eeb6ee`. I’m treating that as an external campaign action, not creating or moving the tag. I’m verifying its signature and release workflow state, then I’ll proceed against the workflow-produced artifact only.","turn_id":"01a18c20-aec5-7552-93bd-755d714c245e"},{"complete":true,"message_id":"msg_0db389702a7164cc016ae4663a5790819fbfb7afce057fbaad","order":24247,"phase":"commentary","revision":"retained_01a18c2f-5618-7840-b56d-1683f6a87071","text":"RC14 is now tagged remotely at the CI-passed commit and its GPG signature verifies. The release workflow `41035120551` has started on that exact tag; it is still building the candidate, and GitHub has not published an RC14 release yet. I’m monitoring the workflow-produced artifact rather than substituting a local package.","turn_id":"01a18c20-aec5-7552-93bd-755d714c245e"},{"complete":true,"message_id":"msg_0db389702a7164cc016ae4668acc1c819f98cd7daf53777915","order":24248,"phase":"commentary","revision":"retained_01a18c30-90f6-7d42-9273-e75465bd9fa1","text":"The rebased diagnostic branch’s exact focused rerun has now passed: both synthetic T4 and fake-peer cases passed (2/2) on `c6f00e8f`, with the RC14 release workflow still in its Cargo build step. I’m releasing the GATEWAY claim and recording this result; I’ll defer PR creation until the release workflow’s full suite ends.","turn_id":"01a18c20-aec5-7552-93bd-755d714c245e"}],"assistant_messages_incomplete":true,"incomplete":false,"next_order":24250,"sender_deliveries":[{"order":15987,"receiver_message_id":"fco_01a17087-cac9-7bf1-9191-300c6bb80f4c","receiver_turn_id":"01a1703b-4280-7320-9374-5c397c112b4d","text":"\u003e\u003e\u003e SENDER USER MESSA