ile. [Task 2]\n613:- Exact-head CI is necessary but insufficient: acceptance requires an installed exact RC, sealed held-out corpus, T2/T3/T4, provider/standalone matrices, human terminal acceptance, package/install/reproducibility checks, and owner-supplied independent RC acceptance. [Task 1]\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":30954}},"started_at_ms":1793353463455,"completed_at_ms":1793353463456}}
