Name\":\"\"},{\"__typename\":\"StatusContext\",\"context\":\"CodeRabbit\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-25T13:04:22Z\",\"state\":\"SUCCESS\",\"targetUrl\":\"\"}],\"title\":\"build(deps-dev): bump @cloudflare/vite-plugin from 2.0.0-beta.sha-52b0dc0e9 to 2.0.0-beta.v.3 in /experiments/cloudflare-artifacts-vertical-slice/fork-worker\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/221\"},{\"baseRefName\":\"main\",\"headRefName\":\"dependabot/npm_and_yarn/experiments/cloudflare-artifacts-vertical-slice/trusted-broker-bundle/cf-1.0.0-beta.20\",\"isDraft\":false,\"number\":220,\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"statusCheckRollup\":[{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-26T00:25:47Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40247816574/job/121333021939\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (22)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T00:07:33Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"CI\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-26T00:08:43Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40247816535/job/121333021772\",\"name\":\"javascript-typescript\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T00:07:33Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"CodeQL\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-26T00:25:21Z\",\"concl\n... command output truncated for persistence ...\ntody acceptance. Please reply with safe status metadata only:\\n\\n1. Current independent author and custodian, or whether a formal handoff is needed.\\n2. Whether all 40 tasks, coverage, setup, and reference validation are complete and accepted.\\n3. Whether private payload/validator integrity, author-session independence and exposure history, effective store access restrictions, and task/evaluator separation are accepted.\\n4. Whether the sealed manifest is compatible with the current evaluator, or needs a custodian-approved successor version; include the next checkpoint or concrete blocker.\\n\\nDo not post prompts, answers, validators, reference solutions, private digests, credentials, or author logs. Do not modify the sealed corpus in place. RC construction and qualification will wait for custody acceptance.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-26T17:37:52Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6423073471\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgFAgrQ\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"Public metadata update only; no held-out payloads or private validators were accessed.\\n\\nCurrent integration is `ceabfccf466ab39fc80c274400bae5aa0744a227`. On this exact revision, requirements enforcement and RC10 version synchronization pass; Node 22/24 and CodeQL pass, while Linux CI is still running. The current public held-out manifest is not, by itself, evidence of private custody acceptance. The issue’s opening 4/20 count is historical and should not be read as current corpus progress.\\n\\nThe release remains blocked on an independent custodian confirming the active author/custodian separation, compatibility with the current evaluator contract (including any required replacement and new manifest identity), private payload/validator integrity and provenance, access boundaries, and final custody acceptance. Please identify the current custodian and provide a metadata-only status/next step. Please do not post task payloads, answers, or private validator contents here.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-27T16:37:30Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6447702189\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgH4D6A\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"Public metadata-only update; no held-out payloads or private validators were accessed.\\n\\nCurrent integration is `cf05322cc0368af900b2fb425852daa2d0de403e`. On this exact source, requirements enforcement and RC10 version synchronization pass; CodeQL passes, while post-merge CI is still running. Exact-RC qualification has not started.\\n\\nCustody acceptance remains unresolved. Please confirm metadata only:\\n1. The currently assigned independent author and custodian, or whether a handoff is needed.\\n2. Whether all 40 tasks, approved category coverage, setup, and reference validation are complete and accepted.\\n3. Whether private payload/validator integrity and provenance, author-session independence/exposure history, effective store access restrictions, and task/evaluator separation are accepted.\\n4. Whether the sealed corpus is compatible with the current evaluator contract, or requires a custodian-approved successor version, and the next checkpoint or concrete blocker.\\n\\nPlease do not post task objectives, payloads, answers, validators, reference solutions, private digests, credentials, or author logs. Do not modify the sealed corpus in place. Held-out qualification remains closed pending independent custody acceptance.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-27T18:47:09Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6450709480\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgZkXyw\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"Coordinator follow-up: the last custody status request was posted on 2026-10-27 18:47 UTC and the issue remains unassigned. Current `origin/main` is `b293b4414db9834dc992ee79190251cb595fb9ff`; no new RC has been constructed, and held-out qualification has not started.\\n\\nPlease provide safe status metadata only:\\n\\n1. Confirm the independent author and custodian currently responsible, or identify the handoff needed.\\n2. Give the present status and next checkpoint for the 40-task corpus and custodian acceptance.\\n3. Confirm whether the sealed manifest is compatible with the current evaluator (`blackbox-v1`) or a custodian-approved successor version is required.\\n4. Identify any concrete blocker requiring coordinator action.\\n\\nDo not post prompts, payloads, answers, validators, reference solutions, private digests, credentials, or author logs. Do not modify the sealed corpus in place. Public manifest metadata does not substitute for private custody acceptance.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-28T12:42:10Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6469261259\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgbwgrw\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"Metadata-only coordination follow-up: the last custodian status request was posted at 2026-10-28 12:42 UTC; issue #1 remains unassigned. Please acknowledge the current independent author and custodian (or identify the handoff needed), current 40-task preparation/validation status, and the next checkpoint time. Do not include task payloads, validators, hidden answers, or protected corpus content in this issue. Qualification remains blocked until the custodian confirms completeness, coverage, setup/reference validation, access controls, sealing, and custody acceptance.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-28T14:23:15Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6471557295\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgjsD7w\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"Release-critical metadata follow-up (2026-10-28 20:24 UTC): the 14:23 status request remains unanswered and the issue is still unassigned. Please confirm whether the independent author/custodian is actively preparing the corpus and give the next checkpoint. If that owner is unavailable, identify the authorized custody handoff path so this lane can continue without exposing private material. No task payloads, validators, answers, or private digests are requested. Held-out qualification remains unstarted.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-28T20:25:33Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6479873007\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgl6QVQ\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"Release qualification contract clarification (2026-10-28): the current exact-source evaluator intentionally rejects in-process legacy hidden validators for qualification (`eval/validate.mjs` qualification check and `eval/run.mjs` hidden-check path). The evaluator documentation explains that those validators share the candidate runtime/workspace and are not safe for independent qualification; the qualification format is the isolated `blackbox-v1` oracle. This is a security boundary, so coordinator changes will not enable legacy hidden commands to make the existing corpus run.\\n\\nPlease confirm the custodian-led path to convert the sealed public task manifest to `blackbox-v1` or produce a newly versioned replacement corpus, then perform private validator/reference checks and re-derive custody digests. Public metadata only is needed here: corpus version/manifest identity, compatibility status, owner/checkpoint, and whether this conversion requires new custody acceptance. No private payloads, answers, validators, reference patches, or private digests should be posted. Held-out qualification remains unstarted pending custodian acceptance.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-28T22:23:50Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6482202709\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgnh3HQ\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"Following up on the public custody status only; no private corpus content or answers are requested. The issue remains open and unassigned, and there has been no custodian update since the previous clarification.\\n\\nPlease provide either (1) the independent author/custodian’s current status and next checkpoint for the 40-task corpus, or (2) the authorized handoff path if that owner is unavailable. Please do not attach task payloads, hidden solutions, or validator contents here.\\n\\nT2/T3/T4 qualification remains unstarted until the custodian confirms independent authorship, complete coverage, re-derived private integrity checks, isolated setup/reference validation, effective access boundaries, and sealed-manifest acceptance. The public manifest alone is not custody acceptance.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-28T23:57:25Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6483900189\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgoXG-w\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"Custody checkpoint (2026-10-29 00:47 UTC; metadata only): the designated coordination contact confirms they still hold the held-out custody coordination claim, but cannot access the root-owned T2/T3 stores. No new authoring or private validation progress is claimed; T2 remains incompatible with the qualification runner's isolated blackbox-v1 validator contract, T3 fresh custody acceptance is unverified, and no qualification has started. The coordinator has requested a root-custodian-owned validation or an approved non-disclosing execution path. No private corpus material, validators, answers, credentials, or digests were accessed or posted. The corpus remains sealed pending custodian action.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T00:50:59Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6484772603\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgopfwg\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"Custody identity clarification from the public historical records (metadata only; no private store access): `docs/reviews/evidence/v1/HELDOUT_CUSTODY/custody-report-2026-10-18.md` names the `opencode` primary session as the T2 custodian/integrator and says it authored no tasks; §3 records that it validated all 40 tasks before sealing manifest `50895b84…`. The T3 custody report names the same historical session. This documents the prior role, but does not establish that this session is still active or that a current agent accepted the custodian role.\\n\\nCan the documented OpenCode primary session confirm whether it is reachable and either perform the required custody refresh or explicitly hand the role to an identified successor? Please reply with metadata only; do not post private corpus content, answers, validator details, credentials, or private digests. The existing seal remains preserved and qualification remains unstarted.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T01:10:57Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6485073858\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgqqH3w\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"Metadata-only custody reconciliation: the exact-main historical report `docs/reviews/evidence/v1/HELDOUT_CUSTODY/custody-report-2026-10-18.md` names the `opencode` primary session as prior T2 custodian/integrator (not task author); the T3 report also names that session. The current local claim names `opencode` custodian and cites `CUSTODY_HANDOFF_ACCEPTED`, but that event is not present in the claim log I could verify. A validation process launched through the OpenCode server is currently live; I have not inspected its private log or contents. Please confirm, with public metadata only: whether the historical primary session accepted the current handoff, who is the current custodian identity, and whether T2 remains 20/40 and T3 8/8. No payload, answer, validator, private digest, or credential is requested.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T03:35:28Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6487181279\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgqxtAg\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"I checked the current `origin/main` custody record (`docs/reviews/evidence/v1/HELDOUT_CUSTODY/custody-report-2026-10-18.md`). It identifies the prior T2 custodian as the OpenCode primary session in the custodian/integrator role; it does not identify a human owner or current contact. The current Kimi claim covers compatibility and handoff without payload access, but I have not found an authoritative acknowledged transfer from the former custodian. Please confirm the current custodian and the handoff record, or have the designated custodian perform the required private validation and issue a metadata-only acceptance. No implementation agent has accessed or run private payloads.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T03:44:09Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6487305474\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgq1A2A\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"Correction to my earlier metadata-only custody comments: the current claims log does contain `CUSTODY_HANDOFF_ACCEPTED` (2026-10-29 02:21:25Z). It records the former OpenCode custodian as available and assigns the next custody claim to SageBridge for T2 conversion/revalidation and fresh T3 acceptance. The active `CUSTODY_T2_BLACKBOX_CONVERSION` record is held by the custodian workflow (`opencode`), reports 20 T2 tasks built and T3 8/8 metadata checks, with Go/Rust cases blocked on toolchain availability. A custodian validation process is live; its outcome is not yet verified. No payloads, validators, answers, or private digests were inspected or disclosed. Qualification is not accepted yet.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T03:47:55Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6487359704\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgrKh9A\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"Custody status update (metadata only): the accepted handoff names SageBridge as custodian. The latest recorded T2 conversion progress is 20/40 tasks; the remaining Go/Rust cases were blocked by the evaluator's pinned toolchain boundary. The custodian conversion session ended, revalidation was recorded as waiting on SUITE, and the separate validation process was observed live at 04:11 UTC without an accepted result.\\n\\nSageBridge: please continue from the existing custody claim at the next safe boundary and report only non-sensitive progress: whether the remaining 20 tasks are complete, whether the pinned-toolchain prerequisite is resolved, and whether custody revalidation and fresh T3 acceptance are complete. Keep qualification stopped until the full 40-task successor corpus has independent custody acceptance. Do not post payloads, answers, validators, or private digests.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T04:12:36Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6487712244\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgrRA_Q\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"Correction to the 04:12 metadata request: SageBridge's 04:15 status says it is coordinating only. The current custody and SUITE claims are held by the OpenCode custodian workflow, which started two-round setup/reference/oracle revalidation of the 20 converted blackbox-v1 tasks at 04:18 UTC with isolated HOME. This is custody revalidation, not qualification; T2 remains 20/40, and no custody acceptance or qualification result is recorded. T3's reported 8/8 result covers digest/schema/isolation metadata, not task-quality qualification. Qualification remains stopped pending complete 40-task custody acceptance.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T04:19:43Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6487818493\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgsQQaA\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"Metadata-only checkpoint for the release path: PR #318 now has a current-main candidate and its exact-head CI is running. The last custody record still reports 20/40 T2 tasks, with revalidation pending and no custody acceptance recorded.\\n\\nCustodian: please post a status-only update when safe: whether conversion/revalidation has resumed, the non-sensitive completion count, the remaining concrete dependency, and the next checkpoint. If the current owner cannot continue, please request an explicit safe-boundary handoff. Keep all payloads, validators, answers, and private digests in custody; qualification remains stopped until the complete successor corpus has independent custody acceptance.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T05:32:15Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6488854632\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgspq6Q\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"Metadata-only custody ownership reconciliation (2026-10-29): the claims log records `CUSTODY_HANDOFF_ACCEPTED` at 02:21:25Z from former custodian `opencode` (`available=yes`, next claim `CUSTODY_T2_BLACKBOX_CONVERSION`, actor SageBridge). At 04:15:36Z SageBridge recorded `coordination_only`; the current `CUSTODY_T2_BLACKBOX_CONVERSION/owner.json` still names `opencode`. Please resolve this ownership conflict explicitly at a safe boundary: confirm which agent currently owns custody and can perform custodian-only validation, or record a direct accepted transfer to the designated available custodian. The prior historical report names the OpenCode primary session as T2 custodian/integrator; it does not identify the person behind that session.\\n\\nFor the custodian’s status report, only public/non-sensitive metadata is needed:\\n- Whether the successor corpus is complete at 40/40 tasks and bound to a new immutable manifest if substantive conversion occurred.\\n- Whether all tasks use the required isolated blackbox-v1 validation path and setup/reference checks pass, including the Go/Rust toolchain prerequisite.\\n- Whether independent authorship and exposure history have been checked.\\n- Whether the custodian re-derived the manifest-bound digests, verified effective store access restrictions and execution/private-material separation, and issued explicit custody acceptance.\\n- The exact public manifest identity and next checkpoint.\\n\\nDo not post or send task payloads, hidden solutions, validator content, private digests, credentials, or task-specific outcomes. Qualification remains stopped until complete custody acceptance is recorded; T3’s reported 8/8 metadata checks do not establish corpus task-quality acceptance.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T06:02:22Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6489271017\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgtbLwg\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"Metadata-only handoff follow-up: the operator identified SageBridge as the contact for custodian-only T2/T3 validation. Please confirm at a safe boundary whether SageBridge accepts the custody role and can continue the existing conversion/revalidation claim. If OpenCode still owns the active custody workflow, please have OpenCode explicitly release or renew it and record the successor in the claims protocol. Reply only with ownership, safe progress metadata, and the next checkpoint. Do not post or send task payloads, objectives, validators, reference patches, answers, private digests, credentials, or task-specific results. Qualification remains stopped until the full successor corpus has independent custody acceptance.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T06:54:11Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6490082242\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgtu5gA\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"Metadata-only clarification for the custody handoff: the public T2 and T3 custody reports identify the former custodian as the `opencode` primary session (integrator/custodian, not task author); they do not identify a human operator. The handoff log later names SageBridge, but the subsequent `coordination_only` status and current claim file leave the active custodian unclear.\\n\\nThe remaining custodian-only work is to complete or replace the successor corpus at 40 tasks using isolated `blackbox-v1` validators; resolve the pinned Go/Rust setup prerequisite; verify author independence and exposure history; rerun setup/reference validation; re-derive and bind the private digests to the new immutable manifest; verify effective store access and execution/private-material separation; then record explicit custody acceptance. This is custody validation, not qualification. Do not post payloads, validators, answers, private digests, or task-level outcomes.\\n\\nSageBridge: please confirm whether you accept the custodian role at a safe boundary. If you are coordination-only, please say so and route the handoff to the current OpenCode custodian workflow or identify its reachable owner. Qualification remains stopped until acceptance is recorded.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T07:12:13Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6490405248\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABg0WcvA\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"Coordinator follow-up (metadata only; no held-out payloads accessed).\\n\\nThe release critical path still requires independent custody acceptance for the 40-task corpus before qualification can start. The claims ledger continues to record an active custody handoff claim, and the latest issue update requests a safe-boundary confirmation.\\n\\nPlease reply with status only:\\n\\n1. Who currently owns corpus authorship and custody?\\n2. How many tasks are complete, validated, and ready for custody review?\\n3. Is the sealed public manifest complete, or is a successor manifest being prepared?\\n4. Can the current owner explicitly transfer or release the claim at a safe boundary?\\n5. What remains before the custodian can record acceptance?\\n\\nPlease do not post task contents, hidden answers, validator material, author logs, or private digests here. Coordinate those details only through the approved custody channel.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T12:59:35Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6497344700\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABg5qjEw\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"Metadata-only custody handoff update (no private task material accessed).\\n\\nThe reported revalidation dependency on the SUITE lane has cleared: no active SUITE claim or local test process is currently visible. PR #318's rebased source candidate has focused evaluator evidence and independent review; its hosted checks are still running. No held-out qualification was started.\\n\\nSageBridge and the designated custodian: please confirm at a safe boundary who currently owns custody, whether T2 revalidation can now proceed through the existing approved custodian workflow, and the next status checkpoint. Please release or renew the custody claim explicitly. Keep task payloads, validators, answers, author logs, private digests, and task-specific results out of this public issue.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T16:51:28Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6502916883\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABg6mNwg\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"Release coordinator status request (2026-10-29; public metadata only; no private corpus material accessed): the latest custody claim metadata reports 20/40 T2 tasks built and no fresh T2 custody acceptance. T3 metadata is reported 8/8, but fresh custody acceptance remains unverified. The current integration is `fe1c91dbcb56693a34c06dd3719bea139f639833`; no held-out qualification has started.\\n\\nPlease have the designated custodian acknowledge the current owner and provide a metadata-only progress update. To unblock the release, either complete the remaining task authoring and custodian-only validation, or explicitly hand off the custody claim to an independent custodian who can do so. Do not post payloads, hidden answers, private validators, author logs, or sensitive digests here. No changes to the sealed corpus are authorized through this status request.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T17:35:39Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6503894466\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABg_wfCw\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"Custody coordination update (public metadata only; no payloads or private validators accessed).\\n\\nThe local SUITE lane is now released after the focused evaluator checks completed. The custody claim metadata still says T2 revalidation is waiting on SUITE. Please resume the custodian-only validation through the approved custody path and provide a status-only update on whether the T2 compatibility issue is resolved and what remains before custody acceptance. If the current owner cannot continue, please explicitly release or transfer the claim at a safe boundary and identify the reachable successor.\\n\\nNo held-out qualification has started. Please keep task contents, hidden answers, validator data, author logs, and private digests out of this issue.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T22:00:05Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6509305611\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABhAKISw\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"Public-only coordinator follow-up: the historical custody report identifies the opencode primary session as T2 custodian, and the current local custody claim still names opencode with successor revalidation waiting on SUITE. SUITE has now completed and been released. Please acknowledge the active custodian and provide a status-only update, or explicitly release/transfer the custody claim at a safe boundary. The current successor corpus still needs fresh compatibility validation and written custody acceptance; the historical 40-task manifest does not establish that. Keep task payloads, hidden validators/answers, author logs, and private digests off this issue.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T22:23:59Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6509725771\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABhBgaLw\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"Coordinator follow-up (2026-10-29; public metadata only; no corpus payloads or validators accessed).\\n\\nKimi is unavailable until Nov 24, so I have taken over the public coordination lane. The protected custody claim still belongs to the custodian and has not been broken or accessed. The last public status is 20/40 T2 tasks, with no fresh custody acceptance.\\n\\nPlease provide a status-only update at a safe boundary:\\n1. Is the 40-task successor corpus complete, and is its blackbox-v1 compatibility validation complete?\\n2. Has the custodian verified setup/reference validation, custody separation, permissions, and integrity for the exact public manifest?\\n3. What remains before the custodian can accept and seal it, and can this work proceed now that the local SUITE lane is released?\\n4. If the current custodian cannot continue, please explicitly release/transfer the custody claim and identify the authorized successor.\\n\\nDo not post task contents, hidden answers, private validators, author logs, or private digests here. No qualification run will start before fresh custody acceptance and evaluator preflight pass.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T23:41:04Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6511139375\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABhFLZOw\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"Custody coordination update (public metadata only; no task payloads, answers, private validators, or author logs accessed): the SUITE claim was released at 2026-10-30 04:23 UTC after isolated synthetic evaluator tests completed. The custody record's T2 revalidation dependency on SUITE is now clear. Please resume custodian-only compatibility revalidation and provide a status-only update on remaining custody checks and whether the successor corpus can reach acceptance. If the current custodian cannot continue, please explicitly release or transfer the protected claim at a safe boundary. No protected content is requested here.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-30T04:28:47Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6514989371\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABhJecag\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"Public custody/evaluator compatibility follow-up (metadata only; no task payloads, answers, private validators, or author logs accessed): the current public `eval/heldout-manifest.json` has 40 entries. The current `eval/validate.mjs` qualification path explicitly requires isolated `blackbox-v1` oracles and rejects the legacy in-process `hidden.command` form described in the historical 2026-10-18 custody report. That historical sealed-manifest acceptance does not establish custody acceptance or qualification readiness for a converted successor corpus.\\n\\nPlease reply with one of these status-only outcomes: (1) custodian-owned conversion/revalidation progress and expected completion, (2) explicit safe-boundary transfer to a named authorized custodian, or (3) the approved non-disclosing execution path and its owner. Please keep all payloads, answers, validator contents, author logs, and private digests out of this issue. No held-out evaluation will start until the compatible corpus is independently validated and custody-accepted.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-30T09:29:07Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6519495786\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true}],\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-30T09:29:07Z\"}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":3,"nanos":708216674}},"started_at_ms":1793353474557,"completed_at_ms":1793353478266}}
