pository>] [-- <gitflags>...] [flags]\n\nFLAGS\n  --clone                 Clone the fork\n  --default-branch-only   Only include the default branch in the fork\n  --fork-name string      Rename the forked repository\n  --org string            Create the fork in an organization\n  --remote                Add a git remote for the fork\n  --remote-name string    Specify the name for the new remote (default \"origin\")\n\nINHERITED FLAGS\n  --help   Show help for command\n\nEXAMPLES\n  # Fork a repository\n  $ gh repo fork owner/repo\n  \n  # Fork a repository and clone it locally\n  $ gh repo fork owner/repo --clone\n  \n  # Fork a repository without cloning it, skip the prompt\n  $ gh repo fork owner/repo --clone=false\n\nLEARN MORE\n  Use `gh <command> <subcommand> --help` for more information about a command.\n  Read the manual at https://cli.github.com/manual\n  Learn about exit codes using `gh help exit-codes`\n  Learn about accessibility experiences using `gh help accessibility`\n\n# Ready-to-run — files ONLY the field report, nothing else.\n# Run these in a clone of xerj-org/xerj, not in the project you are working in.\ngit clone https://github.com/xerj-org/xerj.git\ncd xerj\ngh repo fork xerj-org/xerj --remote --remote-name xerj-fork\nxerj feedback \\\n --agent \"Codex GPT-6.1\" \\\n  --used-for \"Read-only XERJ search to locate Nexus evaluation suite cleanup and child-process timeout tests while release CI suite is running\" --pointed-at \"1051 records under /home/mike/xerj-sources/nexus-code/core/src (autoindex run run-20261028T022152Z-ff10-0000)\" \\\n  --verdict \"Search surfaced relevant cleanup and timeout fixtures in eval_hardened.test.ts and eval_integrity.test.ts, but did not identify the specific non-exiting CLI suite handle; definition-first or focused test-name queries are needed for that diagnosis.\" --numbers \"not measured\" \\\n  -o user-feedback/16-agent-field-reports/2026-10-30-read-only-xerj-search-to-locate-nexus-evaluation.md\ngit checkout -b field-report/read-only-xerj-search-to-locate-nexus-evaluation\ngit add user-feedback/16-agent-field-reports/2026-10-30-read-only-xerj-search-to-locate-nexus-evaluation.md\ngit commit --only user-feedback/16-agent-field-reports/2026-10-30-read-only-xerj-search-to-locate-nexus-evaluation.md -m \"docs(field-report): read-only-xerj-search-to-locate-nexus-evaluation\"\ngit push -u xerj-fork field-report/read-only-xerj-search-to-locate-nexus-evaluation\ngh pr create --repo xerj-org/xerj --base main --head YOUR_LOGIN:field-report/read-only-xerj-search-to-locate-nexus-evaluation \\\n  --title \"Agent field report: Read-only XERJ search to locate Nexus evaluation suite cleanup and child-process timeout tests while release CI suite is running\" \\\n  --body \"Field report only; see user-feedback/16-agent-field-reports/2026-10-30-read-only-xerj-search-to-locate-nexus-evaluation.md.\"\nerror: this account cannot push to xerj-org/xerj, and forking failed: `gh repo fork xerj-org/xerj --remote --remote-name xerj-fork` failed\nNothing was branched.\n\nGitHub is unavailable (the pull request could not be opened (see above)); sending the field report to https://xerj.org/api/field-report instead.\nsent field report to https://xerj.org/api/field-report (HTTP 200)\n{\"ok\":true,\"stored\":true,\"note\":\"Thanks. The canonical path is a GitHub PR: https://github.com/xerj-org/xerj/tree/main/user-feedback/16-agent-field-reports\"}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":18,"nanos":296179073}},"started_at_ms":1793353723410,"completed_at_ms":1793353741707}}
