{"timestamp":"2026-10-30T10:05:09.068Z","ordinal":527693,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18c3d-7cdd-71d3-966d-f30f05df4fb0","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-b056a8aa-2ab0-4895-baaa-975ab233dbb5","process_id":"4186","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","rg -n '^## 3|^### 3|ACC-SUP|ACC-PKG' docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md | head -n 45; git status --short --branch"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/rc14-artifact-verification","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"rg -n '^## 3|^### 3|ACC-SUP|ACC-PKG' docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md | head -n 45; git status --short --branch"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"26:3. **RC artifact gates.** Before installed-RC product qualification, run every G0–G4 check whose acceptance method requires the RC archive, RC attestation/release, or workflow-produced artifact. This includes ACC-SUP-01/02/03/06/08. ACC-PKG checks that explicitly require an installed package run against this RC as specified by their test method. Record the RC tag commit, workflow run, artifact digests, and each check result. A source-level analogue does not replace an artifact-bound check.\n45:| REQ-REL-005 | ACC-SUP-04, ACC-SUP-05 | Exact-RC security and dependency artifact checks |\n48:| REQ-REL-114 | ACC-SUP-08 | Exact-RC cross-runner reproducibility |\n85:## 3. Gate checklist (G0–G4: automated acceptance IDs)\n96:| Packaging | ACC-PKG-01 to ACC-PKG-09 | SPEC-06 |\n97:| Supply chain | ACC-SUP-01 to ACC-SUP-08 (artifact-bound ACC-SUP-01/02/03/06/08 after RC construction) | SPEC-07 |\n104:### 3.1 Acceptance IDs defined in this file\n308:   - ACC-PKG-01;\n334:- [ ] RC artifact gates pass on the workflow-produced RC, including ACC-SUP-01/02/03/06/08; record the exact source commit, workflow run, and artifact digest.\n## v1/rc14-artifact-verification\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":498908918}},"started_at_ms":1793354707568,"comp