{"timestamp":"2026-10-30T10:05:48.736Z","ordinal":527727,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18c3d-7cdd-71d3-966d-f30f05df4fb0","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-d0bd2352-fc31-4134-8c84-b40f7e1d2879","process_id":"68948","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","rg -n \"ACC-SUP-06|release body.*docs|body.*release\" scripts cli/test .github docs/v1.0.0"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/rc14-artifact-verification","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"search","cmd":"rg -n 'ACC-SUP-06|release body.*docs|body.*release' scripts cli/test .github docs/v1.0.0","query":"ACC-SUP-06|release body.*docs|body.*release","path":"scripts"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":".github/workflows/release.yml:131:          body_path: docs/releases/${{ github.ref_name }}.md\ndocs/v1.0.0/REQUIREMENTS.md:201:| REQ-REL-112 | REL-004 (carried) | SECURITY.md, CHANGELOG.md, release body taken from release notes. | supportability | root, `release.yml` | TEST (ACC-SUP-06; test:SECURITY.md, CHANGELOG.md, release.yml) | tested | ACC-SUP-06 | RR | HIST-07, MNT-05 | SPEC-07 / PLAN-07 |\ndocs/v1.0.0/specs/SPEC-07-supply-chain-and-release-engineering.md:45:6. **REQ-REL-112.** SECURITY.md defines the reporting channel, the supported versions and the response targets. CHANGELOG.md is maintained, and the release body is taken from `docs/releases/<tag>.md` (the release fails if that file is missing).\ndocs/v1.0.0/specs/SPEC-07-supply-chain-and-release-engineering.md:69:| ACC-SUP-06 | SECURITY.md and CHANGELOG.md exist. `gh release view <rc>` body equals `docs/releases/<rc>.md`. |\ndocs/v1.0.0/plans/PLAN-07-supply-chain-and-release-engineering.md:33:| 9 | Write `SECURITY.md` (private reporting via GitHub Security Advisories, supported versions, 7-day acknowledgement target) and `CHANGELOG.md` (back-filled from docs/releases). Set the release body from `docs/releases/<tag>.md` (`body_path`), and fail if that file is missing. | root; `release.yml` | — |\ndocs/v1.0.0/evidence/E_distribution.md:76:| MNT-05 | S4 | changelog | docs/releases/*.md; release.yml:47 | SOURCE + RUNTIME. The GitHub release bodies are only \"Full Changelog: compare…\". The curated notes in docs/releases are not attached, and there is no CHANGELOG.md. | Users on GitHub do not see known limits or breaking changes (e.g. `spawn_subagent max_steps` removed). | Use `body_path: docs/releases/${tag}.md`, and fail the release if the file is missing. |\ndocs/v1.0.0/evidence/E_distribution.md:160:| E-R13 | GitHub release body comes from docs/releases/<tag>.md. | docs | POST-V1 | Release view shows the curated notes. |\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":985852561}},"started_at_ms":1793354747747,"completed_at_ms":1793354748733}}
