| Use `body_path: docs/releases/${tag}.md`, and fail the release if the file is missing. |\ndocs/v1.0.0/evidence/E_distribution.md:160:| E-R13 | GitHub release body comes from docs/releases/<tag>.md. | docs | POST-V1 | Release view shows the curated notes. |\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18c3d-7cdd-71d3-966d-f30f05df4fb0","create_time":1793354748.930063}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
