zation passes.\n\n## Gate status\n\n| Gate | Status | Evidence |\n|---|---|---|\n| ACC-SUP-01 | PASS | Release package smoke and `notices-check.log` |\n| ACC-SUP-02 | PASS | Workflow SBOM generation/count check and `sbom-counts.json` |\n| ACC-SUP-03 | PASS | `archive-attestation.json`, `checksums-attestation.json` |\n| ACC-SUP-06 | PASS | `release-body-comparison.txt` |\n| ACC-SUP-08 | IN PROGRESS | Exact-RC two-runner workflow [41038503854](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/41038503854); not yet counted as a pass |\n| Clean installed-RC entrypoint check | PASS | `installer-run.log` |\n\nThe installed-RC product qualification matrix remains in progress. Held-out T2/T3/T4 qualification has not started; it still requires independent custodian acceptance. Provider, standalone, lifecycle, fault-injection, installed-RC PTY, and independent acceptance gates remain outstanding. The manual five-terminal by three-size matrix is waived for v1.0.0 by DEC-20; automated CI PTY and scripted installed-RC PTY remain mandatory.\n\n## Reproduction\n\n1. Download all assets from the release URL in `manifest.json`.\n2. Compare each downloaded file's SHA-256 and size to `release-assets.json`.\n3. Run `sha256sum --check SHA256SUMS` in the asset directory.\n4. Verify the archive and checksum attestations with `gh attestation verify` using the exact signer and repository recorded above.\n5. Follow the captured isolated-HOME install invocation in `installer-run.log` with the published RC installer and `NEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION=1`.\n\n`SHA256SUMS` in this directory covers all retained evidence files, not the public release archive itself; the archive is identified by its public release digest above.\nEOF\n"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/rc14-artifact-verification","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"set -e\nrepo=/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc14-artifact-verification\nevidence=\"$repo/docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.14\"\nassets=/tmp/nexus-rc14-workflow-assets\ngh release view v1.0.0-rc.14 --repo mikeholownych/nexus-code --json tagName,name,isDraft,isPrerelease,targetCommitish,url,assets > \"$evidence/release.json\"\ngh run view 41035120551 --json status,conclusion,headSha,event,workflowName,url,jobs > \"$evidence/release-workflow.json\"\ngh run view 41029564419 --json status,conclusion,headSha,url,jobs > \"$evidence/source-ci.json\"\ngh run view 41029564602 --json status,conclusion,headSha,url,jobs > \"$evidence/codeql.json\"\ngit verify-tag v1.0.0-rc.14 > \"$evidence/tag-signature.log\" 2>&1\ngh run view 41035120551 --log 2>&1 | rg 'Retained [0-9]+ Cargo production dependencies|Generated and validated CycloneDX SBOM|NOTICES_CHECK_PASS|Release ready at' > \"$evidence/package-build-key-lines.log\"\nnode scripts/check_notices.mjs /tmp/nexus-rc14-package-check.qS7YPZ/nexus/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt > \"$evidence/notices-check.log\"\npython3 - \"$evidence\" <<'PY'\nimport json,pathlib,sys\nroot=pathlib.Path(sys.argv[1]); sbom=json.loads(pathlib.Path('/tmp/nexus-rc14-workflow-assets/sbom.cdx.json').read_text()); lock=json.loads(pathlib.Path('cli/package-lock.json').read_text())\ncomponents=sbom['components']; cargo=sum(c.get('purl','').startswith('pkg:cargo/') for c in components); npm=sum(c.get('purl','').startswith('pkg:npm/') for c in components)\nprod=[(k,v) for k,v in lock.get('packages',{}).items() if k.startswith('node_modules/') and not v.get('dev',False)]\nassert cargo==120 and npm==22 and len(prod)==21\n(root/'sbom-counts.json').write_text(json.dumps({'cycloneDx':'1.5 validated by release workflow','componentCount':len(components),'cargoComponentsIncludingRoot':cargo,'cargoProductionDependenciesExcludingRoot':cargo-1,'npmComponentsIncludingRoot':npm,'npmProductionPackagesExcludingRoot':npm-1,'lockfileProductionPackagesExcludingRoot':len(prod),'countsMatchIncludingEachRootPackage':cargo-1==119 and npm-1==len(prod)},indent=2)+'\\n')\nPY\ncat > \"$evidence/release-body-comparison.txt\" <<'EOF'\nGitHub release body and docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.14.md have identical visible content. GitHub's body has one additional terminal LF: source file ends with one LF (3219 bytes); API body ends with two LFs (3220 bytes). After removing terminal LF characters, the byte sequences compare equal. No substantive release-note difference.\nEOF\ncat > \"$evidence/manifest.json\" <<'EOF'\n{\n  \"schemaVersion\": 1,\n  \"requirement\": \"RC artifact verification\",\n  \"acceptance\": [\"ACC-SUP-01\", \"ACC-SUP-02\", \"ACC-SUP-03\", \"ACC-SUP-06\", \"ACC-PKG-01\"],\n  \"status\": \"PARTIAL_PASS\",\n  \"candidate\": {\n    \"tag\": \"v1.0.0-rc.14\",\n    \"tagObject\": \"03770c12a30af830f392eb916122b864c12cf322\",\n    \"sourceCommit\": \"16eeb6eeffe7fc0bae234aa34dcb671a6ba5ff99\",\n    \"releaseUrl\": \"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.14\"\n  },\n  \"workflow\": {\n    \"runId\": \"41035120551\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/41035120551\",\n    \"conclusion\": \"success\",\n    \"sourceCiRun\": \"41029564419\",\n    \"codeqlRun\": \"41029564602\"\n  },\n  \"artifact\": {\n    \"name\": \"nexus-linux-x86_64-v1.0.0-rc.14.tar.gz\",\n    \"size\": 4913202,\n    \"sha256\": \"52d1c855158c63dbc7cac2e9d87e2f64b1feffb193de97660e92276a2bd46eb7\",\n    \"githubApiDigestMatched\": true,\n    \"releaseSha256SumsMatched\": true,\n    \"provenance\": \"VERIFIED: SLSA v1; repository mikeholownych/nexus-code; signer .github/workflows/release.yml; tag refs/tags/v1.0.0-rc.14; source commit 16eeb6eeffe7fc0bae234aa34dcb671a6ba5ff99\"\n  },\n  \"installedCheck\": {\n    \"installer\": \"workflow-produced release install.sh\",\n    \"isolatedHome\": true,\n    \"provenanceRequired\": true,\n    \"runtime\": \"Linux x86_64, Node v24.11.1, glibc 2.39\",\n    \"version\": \"1.0.0-rc.14 (16eeb6eeffe7)\",\n    \"helpExit\": 0,\n    \"installedManifest\": \"all listed package file checksums passed\"\n  },\n  \"artifactAcceptance\": {\n    \"ACC-SUP-01\": \"PASS: release workflow package smoke passed; independent archive notice checker verified 119 Rust crates and 21 production npm packages\",\n    \"ACC-SUP-02\": \"PASS: CycloneDX validation passed in workflow; SBOM has 142 components, matching 119 Cargo dependencies plus Cargo root and 21 production npm dependencies plus CLI root\",\n    \"ACC-SUP-03\": \"PASS: independently verified archive and SHA256SUMS attestations with exact repository, workflow signer, RC tag, and commit\",\n    \"ACC-SUP-06\": \"PASS: release body matches source release notes; GitHub adds one terminal LF\",\n    \"ACC-SUP-08\": \"IN_PROGRESS: exact-RC two-runner workflow 41038503854; not yet passed\"\n  },\n  \"limitations\": [\n    \"This record verifies RC14 artifact integrity and clean installation only; it is not exact-RC product qualification or independent RC acceptance.\",\n    \"Held-out T2/T3/T4, live provider and standalone checks, fault injection, lifecycle matrix, installed-RC PTY, cross-runner reproducibility, and independent acceptance remain outstanding.\"\n  ]\n}\nEOF\ncat > \"$evidence/README.md\" <<'EOF'\n# Nexus v1.0.0-rc.14 artifact verification\n\nThis record binds to the published, signed `v1.0.0-rc.14` tag at source commit `16eeb6eeffe7fc0bae234aa34dcb671a6ba5ff99` and release workflow run [41035120551](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/41035120551). It establishes artifact integrity and a clean install; it does **not** establish product qualification, RC acceptance, or stable-release readiness.\n\n## Verified results\n\n- The release workflow and exact-source CI/CodeQL runs completed successfully. The workflow's Node 22/24 and Linux test/build/security gates passed. Its release job performed two package builds and byte-compared the archive, checksum index, notices, SBOM, and installer; SBOM validation, package smoke, installer smoke, provenance attestation, and release upload all passed.\n- All nine published release assets were downloaded. Their sizes and SHA-256 digests match GitHub's asset API; `SHA256SUMS` validates the RC archive and compatibility metadata. The archive digest is `52d1c855158c63dbc7cac2e9d87e2f64b1feffb193de97660e92276a2bd46eb7`.\n- The archive contains the expected CLI, sidecar/runtime dependencies, `harness-core`, `nexus-tui`, compatibility metadata, package manifest, and third-party notices. The dependency notice checker independently found 119 Rust crates and 21 production npm packages.\n- The SBOM is CycloneDX 1.5 and passes release-workflow validation. It contains 142 components: 119 Cargo production dependencies plus the Cargo root, and 21 npm production dependencies plus the CLI root, matching the exact source lockfiles.\n- `gh attestation verify` independently passed for the archive and `SHA256SUMS`, constrained to repository `mikeholownych/nexus-code` and signer `.github/workflows/release.yml`. Verified provenance identifies the RC14 tag and source commit above.\n- The workflow-produced release installer was run with `NEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION=1` in a disposable HOME. It verified provenance and installed RC14. `nexus --version`, `nexus --help`, the installed package manifest, symlink target, and version file all passed. The installed CLI reported `1.0.0-rc.14 (16eeb6eeffe7)`.\n- The GitHub release body matches `docs/releases/v1.0.0-rc.14.md` in substantive content. The GitHub API representation contains one additional terminal LF; the byte comparison after terminal-LF normalization passes.\n\n## Gate status\n\n| Gate | Status | Evidence |\n|---|---|---|\n| ACC-SUP-01 | PASS | Release package smoke and `notices-check.log` |\n| ACC-SUP-02 | PASS | Workflow SBOM generation/count check and `sbom-counts.json` |\n| ACC-SUP-03 | PASS | `archive-attestation.json`, `checksums-attestation.json` |\n| ACC-SUP-06 | PASS | `release-body-comparison.txt` |\n| ACC-SUP-08 | IN PROGRESS | Exact-RC two-runner workflow [41038503854](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/41038503854); not yet counted as a pass |\n| Clean installed-RC entrypoint check | PASS | `installer-run.log` |\n\nThe installed-RC product qualification matrix remains in progress. Held-out T2/T3/T4 qualification has not started; it still requires independent custodian acceptance. Provider, standalone, lifecycle, fault-injection, installed-RC PTY, and independent acceptance gates remain outstanding. The manual five-terminal by three-size matrix is waived for v1.0.0 by DEC-20; automated CI PTY and scripted installed-RC PTY remain mandatory.\n\n## Reproduction\n\n1. Download all assets from the release URL in `manifest.json`.\n2. Compare each downloaded file's SHA-256 and size to `release-assets.json`.\n3. Run `sha256sum --check SHA256SUMS` in the asset directory.\n4. Verify the archive and checksum attestations with `gh attestation verify` using the exact signer and repository recorded above.\n5. Follow the captured isolated-HOME install invocation in `installer-run.log` with the published RC installer and `NEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION=1`.\n\n`SHA256SUMS` in this directory covers all retained evidence files, not the public release archive itself; the archive is identified by its public release digest above.\nEOF\n"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":7,"nanos":104995551}},"started_at_ms":1793354966685,"completed_at_ms":1793354973791}}
